<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MLK - Bible Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKU</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Malaku</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musamu kásonika Malaku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malaku</para>
  <para style="imt">Khotidi ya mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Malaku wubati zonza kwena bakidisitu bana bakonda kala boosu mu kisina kya bayuta. Wenina Musamu wa Bukheti wa khufi kuluta. Mu kati dyandi mweku meni ditadidi kileki kya Yesu. Mweku phi keti malongi ma kaleyi mana ma Yesu. Kaasi Malaku yandi kabati hana phi mameni ma lawu ma kutundakana, kubeluka yi matendu. Muna mambu mahika, wubati hana tsikiningi ya mambu yina yikondi muna Misamu mya Bukheti myahika.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Malaku wubati landa, mu kimvuka, ndonga ya mambu bwosu básonikabwa muna Misamu mya Bukheti mya Mathayi yi Luka. Kaasi meni dyenina hanga mukhenda wa kuyitwakisa. Tukidila mulonga wa theti, wubati songila Yesu hanga «Mwana wa Nzambi» (1:1). Bela-bela yi tsuka ya Musamu wa Bukheti, Mwana wa Nzambi wufwini, wa kukhoka ha kitakani kimosi (15:39).</para>
  <para style="ip">Muna kyati kya theti muna byodi bya mukanda (1:1—8:26), Yesu kazodiku ni batu batekila bakula bwa buthwena keti nati kenina yandi. Kabati buka bambefu, kabati kukwasa bitembu bya mbi, kabati zonza yi hamu. Batu babati dihyula: «Nati kenina mutu yandu?» Kaasi Yesu wuzimbudini kwena baba bisi dibanzila ni bamuzayi: «Luzimbulaku kwena mutu keti nati yenina.»</para>
  <para style="ip">Kyati kya zodi muna byodi bya mukanda (8:27—16:20) yibati natisa mu kubakula keti bweti kenina Yesu mwana wa Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Batu ba bunzambi ba bisi Loma bakala sangwadila batu bambuta babana bákala koma hanga banzambi. Batu meni babana bakala hanga mambu hanga ma kuyituka, bázayakana lawu, bákala yi kinunga muna mambu ma phasi moosu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kinga, Yesu kenina Mwana wa Nzambi, mu kutambwasaka mu kukala mutu wa kyedika yi mu kulemvukaka kwena Nzambi. Bwabuna, bwámunatisa mu kunyokuka yi kufwa. Kwakala balonguki ba Yesu bábakulabwoku bwabuna mu mbala mosi; bamulosidini Yesu mu tangwa dina babati muzengila lufwa. Satudiyoni mosi wa ku Loma wubati zimbula, mu kumumona Yesu kufwa: «Mu kyedika, mutu yandu, Mwana wa Nzambi kakadikini!»</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu, tangwa kabati dizonzila yandi-meni, kabati disongila hanga Mwana wa mutu. Nzonzidi meni yayina yibati songila mutu wuna káheka Nzambi hamu dyosu, dyakala hamu dya kufundisa yi dya kulolula. Yibati songila hika ni Yesu kákala mutu kyedika. Nzonzidi meni yayina yibati songila diswekamu dina dibati zinga kimutu kyandi yi kitumu kyandi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wa Bukheti kásonika Malaku wubati hyula kyufu: «Nati kenina Yesu?» Heku mutu wufwani mu kuvutula mvutu bwa buthwena. Mukanda wa Malaku wubati landisa nzila yina kálanda Yesu. Wubati sadisa mu kubakula, malembi-malembi, keti nati kenina Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mth 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ywn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Luyandiku lwa Musamu wa Bukheti wa Yesu Kidisitu, Mwana wa Nzambi <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>bwosu bwásonama mwena Mbikudi Yesaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Phitikini mbambala wama ku thwala ya ngeyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">kikuma kya kukuyidika nzila.<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Yi yandi wuna wubati kalunga muna nganga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Yidikenu nzila ya Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">sungikenu mikinda myandi.»<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Bwabuna kálubuka Yowani, kakala botika muna nganga, amana weka longa mbotika ya kusoba bikalulu kikuma kya ndoluka ya masumu. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Bisi kinzunga kya Yuteya boosu yi bisi Yelusalemi boosu bakala kwenda kwakuna kwena yandi amana bakala tambula mbotika kwena yandi, muna Yolutani, yi kufungunaka masumu ma bawu.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Yowani<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yowani Mubotiki </char></note> kákala wavwata muledi wa mwika mya kamela yi mukaba wa tsibu muna mbunda; kakala dya baphasu yi bwiki bwa mu tseki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Kakala longa: «Kabati kwisa kuna manima ma meni, wuna wenina yi ngolu kuluta meni; amana kutu meni ndungiku mu kuzenzama amana yikutumuna musinga wa tsabatu zandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Meni yikala lubotika mu mamba, kaasi yandi kakwisa lubotika mu Kitembu Kyatoma.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbotika yi kimeka kya Yesu Kidisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13">Mth 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Muna bilumbu meni bina Yesu kátuka ku Nazaleti, hata dya Ngadidi, hanga bamubotiki kwena Yowani muna Yolutani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Buna kálubuka Yesu mu mamba, kámona zilu dikanguki yi Kitembu Kyatoma kukulumuka kwena yandi hanga yembi. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Ndinga yáyukalakana kuna zilu: «Ngeyi wenina Mwana wama watondama; mwena ngeyi tsini kyesi kyama.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, Kitembu wámunatisa mu nganga. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Kánanga bilumbu makumaya muna nganga, bisa muleya kwena Satana. Kakala zinga kumosi yi bambisi ba mu tseki; amana banzyo bakala musadila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutedi balobi baya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:2-22">Mth 4:2-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Kunima dya kumukwatisa Yowani mu boloku, Yesu wísa kuna Ngadidi, kakala longa Musamu wa Bukheti wa Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Kakala zimbula: «Tangwa difwani amana Kipfumu kya Nzambi kibwesukini! Balumunenu mbundu amana kwikilenu mu Musamu wa Bukheti!»<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Buna kakala luta muna kabeta ka yanga dya mbuta dya Ngadidi, wámona Simoni yi Andele, phangi wa Simoni, bakala timbula wanda dya bawu muna yanga, mukuma balobi bákala. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Ndandenu amana yilukitula balobi ba batu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Muna mbala mosi, básisa mawanda ma bawu amana benda mulanda. <verse eid="MRK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Buna káphusana ndambu, wámona Zyaki, mwana wa Zebeteya, yi phangi wandi Yowani, bákala phi muna masuwa ma bawu, beka yidika mawanda. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Muna mbala mosi wábatela; bámusisa tata wa bawu Zebeteya muna masuwa yi basadi bandi, amana bámulanda.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubeluka kwa mukwa kitembu kya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Bákota mu Kaphedinawuma. Muna kilumbu kya sabata, wákota muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta amana wáyandika mu kulonga. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Bakala yituka kikuma kya malongi mandi; mukuma kakala longa hanga mutu wenina yi hamu, heku ni hanga balongi ba mitsiku. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Kinga muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta meni yina, mwákala yi mutu mosi wákala yi kitembu kya mbi, hanga wukalungini: <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>«Kikuma kya biki wudikotisidini mu mambu ma betu, Yesu mwisi Nazaleti? Wisini ndangu watuzanga? Nzayi mboti nani ngeyi wenina: Watoma bátuma kwena Nzambi!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesu wákayakya, mu kuzimbula: «Dibata amana lubuka mwena mutu yandu!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Kitembu kya mbi kyálubuka mwena yandi mu kumuningisa ngolu yi kukalunga ngolu. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Boosu báyituka lawu; bakala dihyula bawu yi bawu: «Biki byabi? Malongi mapha, yi hamu dyosu! Kabati senda kwena bitembu bya mbi, amana bibati mulemvukila!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Amana khululuka yandi yámwangana yi tswatsu muna kinzunga kya Ngadidi kyosu.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludini lawu dya bambefu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mth 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Mu kulubuka mu nzu ya kimvuka ya bayuta, wénda ha kimosi yi Zyaki yi Yowani ku nzu ya Simoni yi Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Buko bwa mukhetu bwa Simoni, walandalala kákala hana thangi, kikhafuma kákala kyawu; muna mbala mosi, bámumenikina yandi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Yandi wábwesuka amana wumusimbini kuna koku, wumutelamisini phi; kikhafuma kimuhwini, amana wuyandikini mu kubaheka madya.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Masikidika ha mábwa, kunima kuzyoka kwa tangwa, bakala munatina bambefu boosu yi bakwa bitembu bya mbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Mbanza yosu yákhokana kuna thwala ya mwelu wa nzu. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Kábelula bambefu balawu bakala bela maladi ma mutindu yi mutindu amana wákukwasa bitembu bya mbi byalawu; Kákalaku sisa tangwa ni bitembu bya mbi byayakula, kikuma byákala muzaya keti nati kákala.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukangadi muna Ngadidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Muna suka, bwosu kwákala phipha, Yesu wátokama, wálubuka ndangu kenda ku phungamu amana kwakuna kikuma kya kulombila. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simoni yi bana kákala bawu benda musanda; <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Tangwa bámusengumuna, bamuzimbwadini: «Boosu babati kusanda.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Yandi wubavutwadini: «Thwendenu kuma kwahika, muna mahata ma kinzunga, ndangu kwakuna phi yisamuna musamu; kikuma kya bwabuna yisidikini.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Amana wénda muna kinzunga kya Ngadidi kyosu; mu kusamuna musamu muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta za bawu yi kukukwasaka bitembu bya mbi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludini mbefu wákala yi bwasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mth 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Mukwa bwasi mosi wísa kwena Yesu, wáfukama amana wámubokwadila: «Yuka ni wuzodibwa, fwani watsemisa.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesu yi kiwayi kyosu, wálambula koku, wámusimba amana wuzimbudini: «Nzodibwa, sema!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Muna mbala mosi, bwasi bwámuwaluka; wásema. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yesu wámukebisa, wámulubula <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>mu kuzimbula: «Dikenga mu kumenika kwena mutu. Kaasi ndawenda disongila kwena nganga Nzambi, amana tambika kabu dyaku kikuma kya kudisemisa kwaku bwosu kálongabwa Moyize; kyakála kimbangi kikuma kya bawu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Kaasi yandi, buna kenda, wáyandika mu kumenika mambu mana mámubwila kwena batu mu ndinga ya ngolu yi kikesa yi kuyadingisaka Ndinga mu phila ni Yesu kálendaku hika mu kukota buna bufwani keti mu mbanza yimosi. Kákala watelama kuna phenza, kuna phungamu, amana bakala tuka tselu yi tselu yi kwisaka kwena yandi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubukini kiwokoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mth 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Kunima ndambu ya bilumbu, Yesu wávutuka ku Kafadinawumi. Báyuka ni kuna nzu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mutindu wuna bazonzidi mu khaphu dya 1:29, fwani wabanza ni nzu ya Simoni yi Andele babati zonzila. </char></note> kenina. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Amana háwongama thalu ya lawu dya batu, kwásalaku keti homa, keti ku thwala ya mwelu. Kakala balonga Ndinga. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Hákala hana kati dya bawu yi batu bisa mu kunata kiwokoku mosi bátikula kwena batu baya. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Bwosu bakalaku lenda mu kumutudisa kwena Yesu, kikuma kya mulumba-lumba wa batu, bálungula hana thandu ya mudilu wa nzu yina<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mudilu wa nzu za bisi Phalesitini, wákala wadiyala hanga kitala, bátungawa yi lundu. </char></note> kákala amana báyidika hundu hahana, bákulumuna kiphoyu kina kákala walandalala kiwokoku. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Mu kumona lukwikilu lwa bawu, Yesu wázimbula kwena kiwokoku: «Mwana wama, masumu maku makulolukini.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Hákala hakana yi ndambu ya balongi ba mitsiku, bazakala, bekina dizonzila muna mbundu za bawu meni: <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>«Kikuma kya biki kabati zonzila bwabuna? Nzambi kabati sawula? Nani wufwani kulolula masumu, yuka ni ka yandi meni ku Nzambi lwesi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Muna mbala mosi, Yesu wábakula, muna kitembu kyandi, mabanza bákala mawu; wubazimbwadini: «Kikuma kya biki lwenina yi mabanza ma bwabuna? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Biki byakonda kala phasi, mu kuzimbula kwena kiwokoku: "Masumu maku makulolukini" ho mu kuzimbula: "Telama, bonga thangi yaku amana kangala"? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Kaasi bulungi, ndangu lwazayabwa ni Mwana wa mutu kenina yi hamu dya kulolula masumu ha tsi.» Wuzimbudi kwena kiwokoku: <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>«Yikuzimbwadibwa, telema, bonga thangi yaku, amana vutuka ku nzu yaku.» <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Muna mbala mosi, mutu wuna wátelama, wábonga thangi yandi, wálubuka kuna thwala ya batu boosu, amana báyituka lawu, boosu bakala zatula Nzambi mu kuzimbula: «Khaniku tumona kedi dyambu dya mutindu wawu!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wumutedi Lefi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mth 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesu wálubuka hika ku kabeta ka yanga dya mbuta; mulumba-lumba wa batu wosu wakala kwisa kwena yandi, amana kakala balonga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Mu kuhita, wámona Lefi, mwana wa yakala wa Alufwe, wazakala hana mesa ma kisalu. Wumuzimbwadini: «Ndanda!» Yandu-yandu wátelema amana wámulanda. <verse eid="MRK 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Bwosu kákala ku mesa kuna nzu ya Lefi, tulaki twa phaku lawu yi basumuki bákala hana mesa hakimosi yi Yesu yi balonguki bandi, mukuma lawu bákala mu kumulanda. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Balongi ba mitsiku ba bafwadisi buna bámumona mu kudya hakimosi yi bakalaki ka phaku yi basumuki, beka zimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Kikuma kya biki kabati dila homa hamosi yi bakalaki ba phaku yi basumuki?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Kinga Yesu wáyuka, hanga wubazimbwadini: «Kabanaku benina bakola mu lutu bisi vwa mupfunu wa munganga, kaasi bambefu. Yísaku tela batu ba masonga, kaasi basumuki.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi kuzila kwa madya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mth 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Balonguki ba Yowani yi bafwadisi bakala zila kudya. Batu bahika bisa zimbula kwena Yesu: «Kikuma kya biki balonguki ba ngeyi bisiku zila bawu, kinga balonguki ba Yowani yi balonguki ba bafwadisi bisi zila madya?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesu wávutula: «Banduku ba kikwedi bafwani kuzila madya mu tangwa dina kenina kikwedi hakimosi yi bawu, ku mukinzi wa longu? Tangwa dyosu dina kakála kikwedi hakimosi yi bawu, balendaku kuzila madya.» <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Bilumbu byakwísa bina babákatula yandi kikwedi; hahana nana bazíla kudya, muna kilumbu meni kina.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>«Heku mutu wisi londa kitemba kya muledi wa pha yi muledi wakhulu; kondilo kitemba kya pha kyayáta muledi wuna wakhulu, amana kuyatuka kwa muledi kwakala kwalawu. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Amana kweku mutu wisi longulula vinu dya pha mu bilungu bya khulu; kondilo vinu dyabúla bilungu, yi vinu yi bilungu bizangani; vinu dya pha, difwani mu bilungu bya pha!»<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mth 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Buna kakala hita muna bilanga bya bule kilumbu kimosi kya sabata, balonguki bandi, báyandika kuhela misambu myandi, kinzila-nzila. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Bafwadisi bamuzimbwadini: «Tala, kikuma kya biki babati hangila mambu mana mafwaniku kuhanga mu kilumbu kya sabata?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Benu lwatangaku mambu káhanga Tavidi, tangwa kákala yi lungwa amana wáyuka nzala, yandi yi bana kákala bawu? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Bwosu kákota muna kikumbu kya Nzambi mu tangwa dina kákala Abyatadi mbuta wa banganga Nzambi, wádya mapha ma mulambu. Kinga bulombi ni banganga Nzambi lwesi balendama dya, amana wábahekama phi ndambu bana kákala bawu.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Amana wubazimbwadini: «Sabata básaladya kikuma kya mutu, kaasi mutu káhangamaku kikuma kya sabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Yihana ni Mwana wa mutu kenina kibeni pfumu wa kilumbu sabata.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi mutu mosi mu kilumbu kya sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mth 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Yesu wávutuka hika ku nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. Kwákala kwakuna yi mutu mosi wákala yi koku dyawokumuka. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Batu bakala musimbulula Yesu mu kuzaya kinga kamubelula mu kilumbu kya sabata, balenga mufunda <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Hanga wuzimbudini kwena mutu wuna wákala yi koku dyawokumuka: «Telama hana, ha kati.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Kunima wubazimbwadini: «Biki bilungi mu kusala mu kilumbu kya sabata? Kusala mboti ho mbi? Kuhulula luzingu lwa mutu ho kuzanga?» Kaasi báhwena talala. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Hanga wubatadini boosu yi khabu; mu kiwayi kikuma kya mbundu ya ngolu ya bawu. Wuzimbudini kwena mutu wuna: «Yuna koku dyaku.» Wáyunadya, amana koku dyandi dyátoma. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Buna bálubuka, bafwadisi, benda kutakana yi bakwa kibuka kya Eloti<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kibuka kya Eloti: dingumba meni dina dyákala dyakuyidika yi banduku ba Eloti Atiphasi yi batu bahika bakala mulumisa (mvula 4 ku thwala ya lubutuku lwa Yesu yi kuna mvula 39 kunima dya lubutuku lwa Yesu). Bakala hingila ni bamona keti mutekulu mosi wa kyamvu Eloti Wambuta mu kubayala ndangu kahingana ha kifulu kya pfumu wa mbanza mwisi Loma. </char></note> kikuma kya yandi, kikuma kya kusanda phila yina bamúhondisila.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Milumba-lumba mya batu myisi kwena Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesu wenda hunga ku bela-bela yi yanga dya mbuta kumosi yi balonguki bandi. Mulumba-lumba wa batu lawu bámulanda. Bátuka ku kinzunga kya Ngadidi, ku kinzunga Yuteya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>ku Yelusalemi, ku kinzunga kya Yitumeya<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yitumeyi: kinzunga meni kyaki kyákala kuna banda dya Yuteya amana mwamuna yákala mbanza ya Heboni. </char></note> kuna Sambwa dya Yolutani dya kinzunga kya Tidi yi Sitoni. Batu balawu meni bana, bisa kwena yandi mukuma báyuka moosu mana kakala hanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi ni bamuyidikila masuwa mamosi, ndangu mulumba-lumba wa batu wumulundikisaku. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Mukuma, bwosu kakala belula batu balawu, boosu bana bákala yi makhasi bakala dilosa kwena yandi ndangu bamusimba. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Bitembu bya mbi, tangwa byákala mumona, bakala bwa kuna thwala ya yandi amana bakala kalunga: «Ngeyi wenina Mwana wa Nzambi!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Kaasi yandi wákandisabya ni bamenikaku kwena batu keti nati kenina yandi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu buna kákandikisabya bitembu bya mbi ni bayambula kuzonzila ni Mwana wa Nzambi kákala, buna buzonziku ni Yesu kákalaku mwana wa Nzambi. Mwana wa Nzambi kákala. Kaasi, kázolaku ni bamusamuna mu phila meni yina kondilo muna tangwa meni dina. </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubasodini bawu kumi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mth 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Yesu wátombuka ku mongu; wátela bana kázola amana bisa kwena yandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Kumi yi bodi kábasola, babana káheka khumbu ya bathumwa, ndangu bakala hakimosi yi yandi amana kábatuma mu kusamuna Musamu wa Bukheti, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>yi hamu dya kukukwasila bitembu bya mbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Kábasola bawu kumi yi bodi: Simoni wuna káheka khumbu ya Phetelu, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Zyaki, mwana wa Zebeteya yi Yowani phangi wa Zyaki, kwena bawu káhana khumbu ya Bowanedizi, disongidila: «Mwana wa mubandanu» <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andele, Fidiphu, Batolomi, Mathayi, Toma, Zyaki, mwana Alufwe, Thati yi Simoni mwisi kibuka kya bana bisi nwanina diphanda, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>yi Yutasi Sikadyoti wuna wámulambula Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biwutu bya Yesu bazodi bisa mubonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Kunima, Yesu wávutuka kuna nzu, amana mulumba-lumba wa batu wákhokama hika, mu mutindu wumosi ni bawu balendaku keti kudya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Buna báyuka bwabuna, biwutu byandi bénda ni bamubonga, mukuma bakala zimbula: «Kabatiku dizaya hika!»<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambi mu dyambu dimosi bamufundila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mth 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Balongi ba mitsiku bana bátuka ku Yelusalemi bakala zimbula: «Belezebula kenina yandi, mu ngolu za pfumu wa bitembu bya mbi kisi kukwasila bitembu bya mbi!» <verse eid="MRK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yesu wábatela amana wáyandika mu kubazimbwala mu bingana: «Abweti Satana kalenda kukwasa Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Honi kipfumu kimosi kyadikabisa kyawu meni, kipfumu meni kina kyazíluka; <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>amana honi nzu yimosi yadikabisa yawu-meni, nzu meni yina yaléndaku hika kuzyama. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Amana yuka ni Satana kadinwanisa yandi meni, wa kudikabisa kenina amana kazyamaku, yimeni wukulukini kwandi.<verse eid="MRK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>«Ka mutu ku wakóta mu nzu ya yakala-phandi ndangu kamuyiba bima byandi konda katekila mukasa yakala-phandi wuna; amana kunima kalunga tambula byosu mu nzu yandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Abwabuna yiluzimbwadini: Moosu kalólulama kwena bana ba batu, masumu yi ngusi zina bahitikisini. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Kaasi wosu wuna wulewudi Kitembu Kyatoma, kalendaku tambula ndoluka, mukuma wuhodi disumu dimosi dya mvula yi mvula.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yesu kakala bazonzila bwabuna kikuma bakala zimbula: «Kitembu kya mbi kenina kyawu.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngudi yi baphangi ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mth 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Ngudi wa Yesu yi baphangi bandi batudini. Batelamikini hana phenza, bamutedisini. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Batu balawu bakala bazakala mu kabeta ka yandi amana bamuzimbwadini: «Ngudi waku yi baphangi baku ba bayakala yi baphangi baku ba <note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna masonuku mahika, mihowu myami, "baphangi baku ba bakhetu", myena mwoku.</char></note>bakhetu ha nzila benina, amana babati kusanda.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesu wuvutudi: «Banati ngudi wama yi baphangi bama?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Kunima, wásimbulula kwena babana bákala bazakala mu kabeta ka yandi, wuzimbudini: «Talenu: ngudi wama yi baphangi bama. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Kikuma, wosu wuna wisi hanga luzolu lwa Nzambi, yandi wuna phangi wama wa yakala yi phangi wama wa mukhetu yi ngudi wama.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mukuni wa kheni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mth 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Yesu wáyandika hika mu kulonga kuna khungu ya yanga dya mbuta. Mulumba-lumba wa batu balawu wámuzyeta yandi. Hanga wuzanzi mu masuwa wuzakadini mwamuna. Mulumba-lumba wa batu wosu ku tseki, bela-bela yi yanga dya mbuta. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Kakala balonga mambu ma lawu mu bingana amana wekina bazimbwala muna malongi mandi: <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>«Hinikinenu! Mukuni wálubuka mu kwenda mwanga mbutu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Buna kakala mwanga kheni, ndambu yahika yenda bwila mu nzila: banuni bisiya dya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Ndambu ya hika yenda bwila muma mwa matadi, muna mwakonda kala mafu ma lawu. Hanga yibufudi tswatsu, kikuma mafu mákalaku lawu; <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>kaasi ha kwátwa mwini, yáyokama amana yáyumuka mukuma yákalaku yi misodi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Yahika yenda bwila ha kati kya tsaku. Tsaku záleya amana zákakidisaya, amana konda kuha keti kheni. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Kaasi kheni yikwawu yábwila mu mafu ma bukheti; yámena, yákola phi, ku tsuka yihe kheni: yimosi yálubula makumatatu, yikwawu makumasambanu, yikwawu hika khama<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbutu zina bakatula zoosu zakala za bukheti kuluta. Kitesu kya ndambu yina bakala hela batu ku kinzunga kya Ngadidi yi Yuteya muna tangwa meni dina, kyakala kya ngenza kumi muna kosu ngenza yina bakuna. </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Amana kakala zimbula: «Wuna wenina yi matu ma kuyukila, kayuka!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kikuma kya biki Yesu kakala zonzila mu bingana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mth 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Buna kákala kuna phungamu, bana bámuzyeta, hakimosi yi bawu kumi yi bodi, báyandika mu kumuhyula kikuma kya bingana. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Amana kakala bazimbwala: «Kwena benu, kitsweki kya Kipfumu kya Nzambi kyáhanamina; kaasi kwena babana benina ku phenza, moosu misi hitila mu bingana, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>ndangu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">«Basímbulula kwa bawu, kaasi bamónaku kima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">bahínikina kwa bawu, kaasi babákulaku kima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">hanga bavutukisa nana kumanima amana masumu mabaloluka nana.»<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubangumuni kingana kya mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mth 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Yesu wubazimbwadi hika: «Lubatiku bakula kingana kyaki? Amana abweti lwalenda bakula bingana byosu? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Mukuni kabati mwanga Ndinga ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Bana benina mu kati kya nzila, mwena bawu yámwanganina Ndinga, kaasi muna kuyukilaya phi Satana wisi katula Ndinga meni yina bámwangiki mwena bawu. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Amana kwena yina bámwanga muna muma mwa matadi, yi batu babana, buna bisi yuka Ndinga, batambwasiya yi kyesi, <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>kaasi beku yi misodi mwena bawu meni, bisi zyama lwesi mu tangwa dimosi; amana yukani kiwayi kondilo munyanga wisa kikuma kya Ndinga ya Nzambi, kyekina kisinza kikuma kya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Yikwawu yina yábwila ha kati kya tsaku; benina babana bisi yuka Ndinga, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>kaasi phasi za tsi, byesi bya bimvwama bya luvunu yi mabanza mahika ma mutindu yi mutindu bisiya kakidikisa Ndinga, amana yihesiku. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Kaasi yahika yina yámwangana mu mafu ma bukheti; benina babana bisi yuka Ndinga ya Nzambi, batambudiya amana yibuti kheni; yimosi makumatatu, yikwawu makumasambanu, yikwawu khama.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mwinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Yesu wábazimbwala hika: «Mwinda, ku sina dya nzungu ya tuma bisiwa sya kondilo ku tsi ya thangi? Keku ha thandu ya muzanga wa mwinda? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Mukuma heku kima kyaswamana, kyakonda zayakana, heku kitsweki kyakonda tunguluka mu kati kya mwini. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Honi mutu wenina yi matu ma kuyukila, kayuka!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Kakala bazimbwala hika: «Kebenu mu mana lwisi yuka! Bakwisa lutesila muna kitesu kina lwisi tesila benu-benu; amana bayíka hika kikuma kya <note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kingana kyaki kibati songila, haha, ni bwosu bisi dihana batu mu kuyuka yi kubakula malongi ma Yesu, bwabuna phi Nzambi kayíkila mbakisilu ya bawu. </char></note>benu. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Mukuma bahána kwena wuna wenina kedi yi kima; kaasi kwena wuna wukondi kima, bamúkatula keti kina kenina kyawu.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mbodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Yesu kakala zimbula hika: «Phila mosi yi Kipfumu kya Nzambi, kyenina hanga mutu wubati mwanga kheni mu kilanga kyandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Kanimba kondilo katokama, phipha yi mwini, kheni yisi mena amana yikodi konda kazaya keti khi mutindu. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Mafu mabati menisa kheni mawu meni: theti ngwalengi, kunima misambu, tsuka-tsuka mbongu yikodi. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Buna kyisi benga kibundu, batambudi mbedi, mukuma tangwa dya kuhelakya dilungidini.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya kheni ya mutadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mth 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Yesu kakala zimbula hika: «Yi biki twalenda fwanikisa Kipfumu kya Nzambi? Yi khi mutindu wa kingana twalenda fwanikisakya? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Kifwanani yi kheni ya tidi, buna batimbudiya muna mafu, yenina kukeya kuluta kheni zoosu za mu mafu. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Kaasi buna bakuniya, yileyi, mihandi mikodi kuluta miti myosu myenina mu masamba amana yilubudi mihandi mya mbuta, keti banuni ba ku zilu bafwani kutunga mazamba ma bawu muna tsya kivula kyandi.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Muna lawu dya bingana bya mutindu meni wuna mwa mwamuna Yesu kakala balongila Ndinga ya Nzambi, bwosu buna báfwana kuyukila. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Kakalaku bazonzisa konda ni kata kingana; kaasi mu kingenga, kakala tendula moosu kwena balonguki bandi.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wulembikini kimbongila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mth 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Muna masikidika ma kilumbu meni kina, Yesu wubazimbudi kwena balonguki bandi: «Tulabukenu ku sambwa dina.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Kunima dya kusula mulumba-lumba wa batu, bámunata muna masuwa mana kákala. Hákala phi yi masuwa mahika hakimosi yi yandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Kimbongila kimosi kya ngolu kyátukula, makaka menika dibunda kuna masuwa, hanga masuwa mazodi mabasa yi mamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Yandi wanimba kákala kuna manima ma masuwa, mutwa hana mbumbi ya mutwa. Bámutokamisa amana bámuzimbwala: «Mulongi, tukulukini amana ngeyi bubatiku kuheka pasi?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Yesu wátokama, wákaya kimbongila, amana wáhana muswa kwena yanga dya mbuta: «Kala talala, dibata!» Kimbongila kyádibata amana talala dya lawu dyákota. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Kunima Yesu wábazimbwala: «Kikuma kya biki lwenina yi bweya bwabuna? Lweku kedi yi lukwikilu?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Hanga kitswi kibakwati, bábanga lawu, bakala dizimbwala bawu yi bawu: «Amana nati kenina yandundu, ni keti kimbongila, keti yanga dya mbuta byamulemvukilaka?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubukini mutu mosi wákala yi bitembu bya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mth 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Kunima Yesu yi balonguki bandi benda ku sambwa dikwawu dya yanga dya mbuta, ku kinzunga kya bisi Ngelasoni<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngelasoni: Mbanza ya baphani yina yenina kuna beti dya malubwakidi ma tangwa dya yanga dya thibu dya Ngadidi. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Buna kátuluka mu masuwa, mutu mosi wálubuka muna mazyamu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbala za lawu, mazyamu bakalama yidikila muna bitadi kondilo bakalama tokula mu kati dya kalunga tadi.</char></note>, kákala phi wazakama yi kitembu kya mbi wísa kuna thwala ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Kakala zingila hana kati dya mazyamu, amana keti mutu kálendaku hika kumukasa, keti mu muyololu; <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Mukuma, mbala za lawu bakala muzitikila mitaku kuna malu yi miyololu muna moku, kaasi kákalamya tabula yi kutolulaka mitaku. Kwakalaku keti mutu wakala yi ngolu za kumulembikila. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Kosu tangwa, phipha keti mwini, kakala kangala muna mazyamu yi muna mongu, mu kukalungaka yi kudityonunaka yandi meni ku matadi. <verse eid="MRK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Buna kámona Yesu muna kyana; wénda thinu, wáfukama kuna thwala ya yandi, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>amana wákalunga: «Khi dyambu wumvwini ngeyi, Yesu, Mwana wa Nzambi Kahungu? Yikubokwadidini, muna khumbu ya Nzambi, wungyangisaku!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Mukuma Yesu kakala muzimbwala: «Kitembu kya mbi, lubuka mwena mutu yandu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Kakala muyufula: «Biki khumbu yaku?» Yandi wávutula: «Khumbu yama "Khwingi", mukuma lawu thwenina.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Amana mutu wuna wámubokwadila Yesu yi nziki-nziki ni katumaku bitembu bya mbi ku phenza ya kinzunga.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Kinga kwákala kwakuna, bela-bela yi mongu, yi kibuka kimosi kyambuta kya bangulu bakala dya<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta bákala mubongila ngulu hanga mbisi mosi wa sumuka amana bákala kandisa kwena batu ni bamudyakaku. Mambu mama moosu babati songila ni mu tsi ya baphani makala hitila. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Bitembu bya mbi byámubokwadila: «Tutuma mwena bangulu bana. Tuyambula thwenda kota mwena bawu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesu wátambwasabwa. Hanga bitembu bya mbi bilubukini mwena mutu, byenda kota mwena bangulu, amana kibuka kyosu kyádidindumuna muna mungulunga yi kuna yanga dya mbuta. Hákala kitesu kya mafunda modi ma bangulu; bázyonda muna yanga dya mbuta. <verse eid="MRK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Babana bakala hungula bangulu bátina, benda nata tsangu muna mbanza yi muna mahata amana batu bisa tala mana máhita. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Buna bátula bela-bela yi Yesu, bámona mutu wuna wákala yi bitembu bya mbi wazakala, wuvwatikini miledi yi mabanza ma kimutu. Yandi wuna wákala wazakama yi khwingi ya bitembu bya mbi hanga báyuka bweya. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Babana bámona mana máhita, bakala bamenika mana mámubwila mutu wuna wákala yi bitembu bya mbi yi meni dya bangulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Hanga bayandikini mu kubokwadila Yesu ni kakatuka mu kinzunga kya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Buna kakala kota mu masuwa, mutu wuna bálubula bitembu bya mbi wámubokwadila ndangu kakalaka yi yandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Kaasi Yesu kátambwasaku, wumuzimbwadini: «Vutuka ku nzu yaku, kwena biwutu byaku amana wabámenika moosu mamana kakuhangidini Pfumu yi buna kakuyukidini kiwayi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Wénda kwandi amana wáyandika mu kusamuna muna Mbanza kumi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbanza kumi: Kimvuka kimosi kya mbanza za luyalu za baphani. Mbanza vwa, muna kimvuka meni kina, zákala kuna sambwa dikwawu dya Yolutani. </char></note> moosu mana káhanga Yesu kikuma kya yandi. Amana boosu báyituka lawu.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukhetu wuna wasimba muledi wa Yesu yi mwana wa mukhetu wa Yayilusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mth 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesu wávutwakisa hika ku sambwa dikwawu dya yanga dya mbuta muna masuwa. Mulumba-lumba wa batu lawu bisa wongama bela-bela yi yandi. Ku khungu ya yanga dya mbuta kákala. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Mosi wa bapfumu ba nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta, khumbu yandi Zayilusi, wátula. Buna kámona Yesu, wábwa muna malu mandi <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>amana wámubokwadila lawu: «Mwana wama wa mukhetu mu kulakana kenina. Awisa, muthetika moku ndangu kabeluka amana kazinga!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yesu wénda hakimosi yi yandi. Mulumba-lumba wumosi wa batu balawu bakala mulanda yi kumufitikisaka tselu yi tselu.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Kinga hákala hakana yi mukhetu mosi wakala noka menga tukidila mvula kumi yi zodi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Kányokuka lawu mu kukwendaka kwena bandomvi balawu, amana, wámanisa kuvwa kwandi kwosu konda kutambula ndandu; kaasi phasi zakala muvula hika. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Buna káyuka kuzonzila Yesu, wísa bwesuka muna mulumba-lumba wa batu, kuna kunda dya Yesu, wásimba muledi wandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Mukuma kakala dizimbwala: «Yukani yisimba lwesi myawu meni miledi myandi, yíkola.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Muna mbala mosi, menga mámukangama amana wádiyuka muna lutu lwandi, ni wukodi mu makhasi mandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Muna mbala mosi, Yesu wádiyuka mwena yandi-meni ni ngolu zimosi zimulubukini. Kahanga wubalungini muna mulumba-lumba wa batu amana wuyandikini mu kuzimbula: «Nati wusimbi miledi myama?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Balonguki bandi bamuzimbwadini: «Wubati mona mulumba-lumba wa batu baba babati kufitikisa tselu yi tselu, amana wubati zimbula hika: "Nati wutsimbini?"» <verse eid="MRK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Kaasi kakala simbulula muna kabeta ka yandi mu kumona wuna wáhanga bwabuna. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Mukhetu wuna, bwosu kázaya mana mámubwila, yi tsula yosu, wisa bwa muna malu mandi hanga wumuzimbwadi kyedika kyosu. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Kaasi Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Mwana wama wa mukhetu, lukwikilu lwaku lukuhuludini<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fwani twazimbula ni "lukuhuludini" kondilo "lukubeludini". </char></note>. Ndawenda mu ngemba amana kola mu makhasi maku.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Muna tangwa dina kakala zonza bwabuna, kutala batu bátuka ku nzu ya Zayilusi bisi zimbula: «Mwana waku wa mukhetu wufini. Kikuma kya biki wubati muyangisila hika Mulongi?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Kaasi Yesu kálandaku mana bakala zonza, wázimbula kwena Zayilusi: «Wuyukaku bweya, kwikila lwesi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Kaasi Yesu kátambwasaku ni benda musindikila kwena mutu, kwena Phetelu lwesi, Zyaki yi Yowani phangi wa yakala wa Zyaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Ha bátula ku nzu ya Zayilusi; kwakuna, wámona mvwalangani, batu babati dila yi kukalungaka mu miboku. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Wákota amana wábazimbwala: «Kikuma kya biki mvwalangani yayi yi bidilu byabi? Mwana kafiku, wunimbiki<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:39</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu kakala zaya ni mwana wa mukhetu wafwa kakala, kaasi yandi lwesi wazaya ni lufwa lwandi lwakalaku kimakulu. Kakala zaya ni, ka thama ku, kamuvutula mu luzingu.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Bawu bakala museya. Kaasi yandi wábakukwasa boosu, wutambudi lwesi tata yi ngudi wa mwana, yi balonguki bana bakala musindikila; amana wákota muna kákala mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Yesu wámusimba mwana kuna koku amana wumuzimbwadi: «<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tadita kum: mihowu myodi mya ndinga ya Bayuta, yina bakala zonza Bayuta mu tangwa dya Yesu. </char></note>Tadita kum!» Disongidila: «Mwana wa mukhetu, yikuzimbwadibwa, telama!»<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Muna mbala mosi, mwana wa mukhetu wátelama amana wáyandika kukangala; mvula kumi yi zodi kákala zawu. Mabanza mábavwalangana boosu. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Kaasi Yesu wátoma bakandisa ni keti mutu kazayabwoku, amana wuzimbudini: «Muhekenu bima bya kudya.»<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Bakwa Nazaleti babwisi mu kukwikila mwena Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mth 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Ha kákatuka hakana, wenda ku mbanza yina kákodila; amana balonguki bandi bámulanda. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Tangwa kyáfwana kilumbu kya sabata, wáyandika mu kulonga muna nzu ya kimvuka ya Bayuta. Batu balawu bana bakala hinikina, báyituka lawu. Beka dihyula: «Ku biki mamutukidi mamana? Khi mutindu wa mudimu wana bámuheka? Abweti biphadi bya mutindu wuna bifwani kusalamina mu moku mandi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Ka yandi ku musadi wa mabaya, mwana wa Madiya, phangi wa Zyaki, Zoze, Yuta, yi Simoni? Baphangi bandi ba bakhetu benahoku ha kati dya betu?» Kákala kisinza kikuma kya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yesu kakala bazimbwala: «Mbikudi bisiku mukanda lukumu, kaasi kisiku lumina mu tsi yandi yi muna kikanda kyandi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Yesu kalendaku kusala keti kiphadi kimosi kwakuna, kaasi kábuka lwesi ndambu ya bambefu mu kubathetika moku. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Kakala yituka kikuma kya kukonda kwa lukwikilu kwa batu ba ku tsi yandi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Kituma kya bathumwa kumi yi bodi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mth 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Kunima kakala kangala muna mahata ma kinzunga mu kulongaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Buna kátela bawu kumi yi bodi, wáyandika mu kubatuma bodi-bodi yi kubaheka hamu hana thandu ya bitembu bya mbi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Wábaheka mutsiku wawu: «Lunataku kima mu nzila, koka lwesi; keti dipha, keti waba, keti dikuta dya phalata muna khola. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Vwatenu tsabatu, kaasi lunataku bikutu byodi.»<verse eid="MRK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Kakala bazimbwala hika: «Muna nzu yina lwakóta, kalenu mwamuna kilumbu yi kuna lwakátwakila homa meni hana. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Amana yukani batu babusa mu kuluyamba keti mu kuluhinikina, mu kukatuka hana meni, khukumunenu fusyangeni dya bitambi byenu: kyakála kimbangi<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kukhukumuna fusyangeni dya bitambi bya bawu, kyákala kidimbu mu kusongila ni batu bana babwisiwa musamu. Mambu mana matadiku hika bamwangi tsangu, kaasi matadi batu meni bana. Disongidila ni mbambala kafwaniku hika kabahangila kima batu babana, keti fusyangeni dya mbanza ya bawu dina dyáfwana kunama ku tsabatu zandi. Kufwanikisa yi Mhb 13:51; 18:6 </char></note> kikuma kya bawu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Amana buna bénda balonguki, bálonga kwena batu ni mboti babalumuna mbundu. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Bakala kukwasa bitembu bya mbi lawu yi kusita masi kwena bambefu amana bakala kola.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Yowani Mubotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mth 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Kinga kyamvu Eloti wáyuka buna yakala kwenda khumbu ya Yesu khululuka. Bahika bakala zimbula: «Yowani, wuna wakala botika, wufutumuki ha kati dya bafwa! Hahana kenina yi ngolu za kuhangila biphadi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Bahika bakala zimbula: «Yandu Diya.» Bahika phi: «Yandu mosi wa bambikudi bana bakhulu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Kaasi Eloti mu kuyuka bwabuna, kakala zimbula: «Yowani wuna yibukwasa meni mutwa, yandi wufutumukini!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Mukuma yandi-meni Eloti wámukwatisa Yowani, wámukasisa miyololu mu boloku. Kikuma kya Elodyadi, mukhetu wa Fidiphu, phangi wandi wa yakala, wuna kákwela. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Kikuma Yowani kakala zimbula kwena Eloti: «Wulungiku mu kukwela mukhetu wa phangi waku!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Elodyadi kikudi-kudi kya Yowani kákala kyawu amana kakala zola ni kamuhondisa. Kaasi kakalaku lenda. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Mukuma Eloti bweya bwa Yowani kákala bwawu, bwosu kázaya ni mutu wa masonga yi watoma kákala amana kakala musweka. Tangwa kakala muyuka, kakalaku mona kima kya kuhanga; kinga kakala muhinikina yi tsambu. <verse eid="MRK 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Kaasi phila yámonika mu kilumbu kya mukinzi wa lubutuku lwa Eloti, kásadisa mukinzi kikuma kya batu bandi ba luzitu yi bapfumu ba baphumbulu yi bapfumu ba mahata ma kinzunga kya Ngadidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Mwana wandi wa mukhetu, Elodyadi, wákota hana mbasi amana wákina; Eloti yi batu bana kátedisa bwábasephidisa lawu. Kyamvu wázimbula kwena mwana wa mukhetu: «Ndomba kyosu kina wuzodini, amana yikúhekakya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Hanga wudi ndefi ya mukwandi kwena mwana wa mukhetu: «Kina wandómba, yikuhekakya keti kyati kya kipfumu kyama.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Mwana wa mukhetu wálubuka amana wázimbula kwena ngudi wandi: «Biki yilómba?» Yandu-yandu wávutula: «Mutwa wa Yowani, wuna wakala botika.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Mwana wa mukhetu wénda tswasu kwena kyamvu mu kumulomba: «Nzodi ni wapheka, buthwena meni bwabu, ha dilonga, mutwa wa Yowani Mubotiki.» <verse eid="MRK 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Kyamvu Eloti wáyuka kiwayi kya lawu; kaasi, kikuma kya ndefi yina kádya ku thwala ya babana kátedisa, kázolaku mu kumutuna. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Muna mbala mosi, kyamvu wátuma tsinzidi mosi yi muswa wa kunata mutwa wa Yowani. Tsinzidi wenda mubukuna Yowani mutwa muna boloku. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Kunima wisa nata mutwa wandi hana dilonga. Wáhanawa kwena mwana wa mukhetu, amana mwana wa mukhetu wáhanawa kwena ngudi wandi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Buna báyuka musamu wuna, balonguki ba Yowani, bisa bonga mvumbi yandi amana bázikaya muna mazyamu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisini bayakala mafunda matanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mth 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ywn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Bathumwa bákutakana kuna kakala Yesu, bámumenikina mambu moosu mana báhanga yi moosu mana bálonga. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Hanga wubazimbwadini: «Alwisenu ku phungamu, homa hamosi hakálaku batu, amana lwalembwa koma.» Mukuma lawu bakala kwisa yi kukwendaka, amana bawu bakalaku keti tangwa dya kudya. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Bahanga bakoti mu masuwa ndangu benda ku phungamu, kuma kumosi kwa talala. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Balawu bábamona mu kukwenda amana bábabakula mu mahata moosu ma kinzunga muna bakala kwenda. Bakala takula mu malu, amana bakala bakesidila kuna thwala.<verse eid="MRK 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Tangwa kátuluka Yesu mu masuwa, wámona mulumba-lumba wa batu lawu; kiwayi kyámukwata, kikuma bákala hanga mikoku mikondi kalema. Amana wáyandika mu kubalonga mambu ma lawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Buna kwáyila kuma, balonguki bandi bisa muzimbwala: «Homa thwenina ha tseki, kuma phi kuyidini. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Basula batu, ndangu benda muna mafedime yi muna mahata ma kinzunga, ndangu badisumbila bima bya kudya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Kaasi Yesu wubavutwadini: «Bahekenu benu-benu madya.» Bawu bamuzimbwadini: «Thwenda sumba mapha ma khama zodi za phata<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phata zazi bakalaza tela ni "dinadiyo". Dinadiyo dimosi dyákala lufutu lwa musadi mosi muna kilumbu. Khama zodi za dinadiyo zákala lufutu lwa batu khama zodi muna kilumbu. </char></note> ndangu thwisa badisila?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yandi wubahyudini: «Alwenda taleti, mapha makwa lwenina mawu?» Kunima dya kuzikisa, bávutula: «Mapha matanu yi batsema bodi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Hanga wubasendi ni babazakadisa boosu mu bibuka muna mwangu watsi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Amana batu bázakala mu bibuka bya khama yi bya makumatanu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Wátambula mapha mawu matanu yi batsema bawu bodi, wásekula mesu kuna zilu, wuvutudini matondu kwena Nzambi. Wábukuna mapha amana wáhanama kwena balonguki bandi; ndangu bakabisama. Wákabisa phi batsema bawu bodi hana kati dya bawu boosu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Boosu bádya amana báyukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Amana balonguki bánata bitunga kumi yi byodi bya bitini bya mapha yi bya batsema. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Babana bádya mapha bákala mafunda matanu ma bayakala.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukangadi ha thandu ya yanga dya mbuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mth 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Ywn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Muna tangwa meni dina, kunima wásenda balonguki bandi bakota mu masuwa amana bamutekidilaka kuna sambwa dya Betisayita, kithama kina kasúdila yandi-meni mulumba-lumba wa batu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Kunima dya kubasula, wenda ku mongu kikuma kya kulombila. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Ha yábwa phipha, masuwa makala matudi kedi ha kati kya yanga dya mbuta. Yesu yandi buhika kákala muna mafu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Mu kumona ni balonguki bandi mu phasi bakala sabwakila, mukuma pfunzi yakala bakakidikisa; muna khoku wa theti, Yesu wísa kwena bawu mu kukangala hana yanga dya mbuta, hanga wuna wabahita. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Tangwa bámumona kukangala ha thandu ya yanga dya mbuta, bakala banza ni kiphedikisa amana báyandika mu kukalunga; <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>mukuma bakala mumona bawu boosu amana mabanza mabavwalangana. Muna mbala mosi, Yesu wázonza kwena bawu: «Kalenu yi kikesa, meni yandu, luyukaku bweya!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Kunima wákota muna masuwa ha kimosi yi bawu, amana pfunzi yálembama. Báyituka lawu, mwena bawu meni <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>mukuma bábakisaku keti kima kikuma kiphadi kina kya mapha: mbundu za bawu zitu zákala.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuki bambefu ku Ngenezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mth 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Buna bámanisa mu kusabuka, bátula ku Ngenezaleti<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kinzunga kya Ngenezaleti: mafu masikunuka mana misi kala kuna banda dya mazyokidi ma tangwa ma Kaphedinawumi.</char></note> amana bátuluka mu mafu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Buna bátuluka mu masuwa, batu bámubakula Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Batu bátuka mu kinzunga meni kina kyosu amana báyandika mu kunata bambefu hana biphoyu, mwosu muna bakala muyukila khululuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Mwosu muna kakala kota Yesu, mahata, mbanza, keti mu mafedime, batu bakala sikula bambefu muna mbasi yi kumubokwadilaka ni kabayambwadila ndangu balenga simba keti nzenzi ya muledi wandi. Amana bambefu boosu bana bakalaya simba, bákola.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma bakhaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mth 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Bafwadisi yi ndambu ya balongi ba mitsiku bátuka ku Yelusalemi bisa kutakana kuna kakala Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Babati mona ni ndambu ya balonguki bandi bekina dya yi moku ma mvindu, disongidila ni makonda kusukula<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kikalulu kimosi muna bikalulu bya Bayuta kyakala lomba mu kusukulaka moku muna mutindu wumosi wuswaswani yi mina myahika ku thwala ya kudya. Bakala kwikila ni wawuna wakala mutindu wumosi wa kusadila ndangu babatambwasa kwena Nzambi. Kaasi Bulunda bwa khulu bwákalaku zimbula ni bwabuna bwakala mboti mu kusukulaka moku ku thwala ya madya moosu ndangu Nzambi katambwasa. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Mukuma Bafwadisi yi Bayuta boosu bisiku dya kedi konda kusukula moku, kikuma bisimya zitisa mikuku mya bakhaka; <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>amana tangwa batukini ku zandu, bisiku dya lwesi kunima dya kudisemisa. Bisi zitisa lawu mikuku myahika mya bakhaka, mu mbandu kusukula kwa makopha, malonga, tulondu, nzungu za bisengu yi [thangi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna masonuku mahika, muhowu wawu thangi weninamwoku. </char></note>].<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Bafwadisi yi balongi ba mitsiku bámuhyula kwena Yesu: «Kikuma kya biki balonguki baku bisiku landila mikuku mya bakhaka, bawu kudyaka moku yi mvindu?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yandi wubazimbwadini: «Bakavungalosi, Yesaya mboti kázonza mu kubikula kwena benu! Bwosu bwásonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">"Kanda dyadi dyisi nzitisila ha munwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">kaasi mbundu yandi kyana yenina yi meni.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Mu phamba bisi pfukamina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">mukuma malongi ma bawu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">myenina mikuku mya batu."<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Lwisi losila mitsiku mya Nzambi amana ludihani ku mikuku mya batu.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Kakala bazimbwala: «Benu lwisi toma losila mitsiku mya Nzambi ndangu lwahalaminaka mu kikhaka kyenu!" <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Moyize kázimbula: "Zitisa tata waku yi ngudi waku", amana phi: "Wuna wasínga tata wandi kondilo ngudi wandi bamuhondisa<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kul 20:12; Klg 5:16 yi Kul 21:17 yi Lev 20:9 </char></note>." <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Kaasi benu, lwisi zimbula: Wuna wazímbula kwena tata wandi kondilo kwena ngudi wandi: "Kina yikhana mu kukuheka kikuma kya kukusadisa kyenina kyakutambika kikuma kya Nzambi<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuta bakala yi kikalulu kya kuhanaka bima kikuma kya kisalu kya Nzambi. Yuka ni balambudi kima kikuma kya kisalu kya Nzambi, bafwanikyoku basadila hika mu mutindu wukwawu. </char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>lwisiku sisa hika kima kya kusala kikuma kya tata wandi kondilo ngudi wandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Bwabuna lwisi zimbikisila ndinga ya Nzambi kikuma kya kikhaka kina lwásambwakisila kwena batu. Amana mambu mahika lawu lwisi sala mafwanakana yi mamana.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bima bina byisi sumuna mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mth 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Yesu wátela hika mulumba-lumba wa batu amana wázimbula: «Ngyukenu benu boosu amana bakisenu: <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Kweku kima kyatuka ku phenza, kyakota mwena mutu kyalenda musumuna. Kaasi kima kina kyisi lubuka mwena mutu, kyakina kyisi musumuna. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Yuka ni matu ma kuyukila lwenina mawu, yukenu mboti.»]<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzila ya mukanda yayi yenamwoku muna masonuku ma lawu mana ma khulu.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Buna kásisa mulumba-lumba wa batu, kávutuka ku nzu, balonguki bandi bámuhyula thendula ya kingana kina. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Yandi wubazimbwadini: «Benu phi lweku yi ngangu? Lwisiku zaya ni heku kima kya ku phenza, kikoti mwena mutu kyalenda musumuna, <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>mukuma kyawu kyisiku kota ku mbundu yandi; kaasi mu kundu dyandi, ku thwala kukwenda mu kabini?» Muna ndinga meni zina, mwamuna Yesu kakala zimbwala ni madya moosu ma kasemi menina. <verse eid="MRK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Kakala zimbula hika: «Kina kyisi lubuka mwena mutu kyakina kyisi musumuna. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Mukuma muna mbundu ya mutu, mwamuna mwisi tuka mabanza mambi: kindumba kya kisaka-saka, bwifi, khengu, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>mbongi, lukusu, khu, nduka za mbi, bizumba, ngusi, kukenga mesu, kuhuna musamu, lulendu, kukonda kubakisa mambu. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Mambu mama moosu mambi myisi lubuka mu kati dya mutu amana myisi sumuna mutu.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwikilu lwa mukhetu mosi wa munzenza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mth 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Buna kákatuka Yesu hahana, wénda ku kinzunga kya Tidi. Wákota muna nzu yimosi, kátondaku ni bamuzaya kwena mutu; kaasi kálendaku mu kuswama. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Muna tangwa meni dina mukhetu mosi, mwana wandi wa mukhetu kákala yi kitembu kya mbi kimosi. Buna káyuka kuzonzila Yesu, wisa dilosa muna malu mandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Mukhetu meni wuna kákalaku Muyuta, mwisi Silo-Fenisi kákala. Kakala mubokwadila ni kakukwasa kitembu kya mbi kina kya mwana wandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Kaasi Yesu kakala muzimbwala: «Yambula theti bana bayukuta; mukuma ka mboti ku mu kutambula madya ma bana, amana batimbulama kwena bambwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Kaasi mukhetu kámuvutwala: «Pfumu, aketi bambwa phi bisi dya bizotu bina bisi bwisisa bana mu tsya mesa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Yandi wumuzimbwadini: «Kikuma kya ndinga yina, vutuka ku nzu yaku, kitembu kya mbi kilubukini mwena mwana waku wa mukhetu.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Tangwa kávutuka ku nzu yandi, káwana mwana walandalala hana thangi, kitembu kya mbi kilubuki kedi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubeludi muhunga mosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Buna kálubuka ku kinzunga kya Tidi, wáhitila ku Sitoni amana wávutwakila ku yanga dya mbuta dya Ngadidi, wáhitila mu kinzunga kya Mbanza Kumi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Bámunatina muhunga mosi wákala babakana mu kuzonza; amana bámubokwadila ni kamusya moku. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesu wámunata ku kingenga kyana yi mulumba-lumba wa batu; wámusya milembu myandi muna matu, wálokula metya amana wámusimba lulaka yi metya mandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Kunima wásekula mesu kuna zilu, wáhumwakina amana wázimbula kwena kahuwa: «Efwata!» Disongidila: "Kanguka!" <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Muna mbala mosi, matu ma mutu wuna mákanguka, lulaka lwandi lwákutumuka, wáyandika mu kuzonza buna bwa bukheti. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yesu wábakandikisa ni bazonzilabwoku kwena mutu; kaasi mbatanana kábakandisabwa, báyadingisawa hika lawu, musamu, kuluta. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Batu báyituka lawu, bakala zimbula: «Moosu kabati hanga menina ma bukheti lawu! Kabati yukisa tuhuwa yi kuzonzisa mihunga!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisini mafunda maya ma bayakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mth 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Muna bilumbu meni bina, hákala yi mulumba-lumba wa batu wumosi wambuta bakhokana hika. Bakalaku keti kima kya kudya. Yesu wátela balonguki bandi amana wábazimbwala: <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>«Kiwayi yenina kyawu kikuma mulumba-lumba wa batu wawu. Tala bilumbu byekina bitatu tukidila buna benina hakimosi yi meni amana beku keti kima kya kudya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Yukani yibasula yi nzala, bakwenda lengalakana muna nzila, mukuma bahika hana kati dya bawu kyana batukini.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Balonguki bandi bamuvutwadini: «Kubiki twawana mapha ma kubadisila mu tseki mwamu?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yesu wubahyudini: «Mapha makwa lwenina mawu?» Bazimbudini: «Tsambwadi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Kahanga wulombi kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu ni bazakala muna mafu. Kunima wábonga mapha tsambwadi amana wávutula matondu kwena Nzambi. Wábukununama amana wáhanama kwena balonguki bandi ndangu bakabisa kwena mulumba-lumba wa batu. Balonguki phi bahangini bwabuna. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Bákala hika yi tuma twa batsema. Kunima dya kubasakumuna, wázimbula ni babakabisa hika. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Batu bádya amana báyukuta. Bátonguna bitunga tsambwadi bya kabasi yi bitini bina byásala. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Bákala kitesu kya mafunda maya. Kunima Yesu wábasula. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Muna mbala mosi, yandi wákota mu masuwa yi balonguki bandi amana bénda muna kinzunga kya Talamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafwadisi balombi kiphadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mth 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Bafwadisi bátula, báyandika kutendana yi Yesu. Amana, kikuma kya kumuleya, hanga bamulombi kiphadi kimosi kyatuka ku zilu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yesu wáhumwakina amana wuzimbudini: «Kikuma kya biki batu ba mbandu yayi babati lombila kiphadi? Mukyedika yiluzimbwadini: yamónaku keti kiphadi kimosi, batu ba mbandu yayi!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Kunima wábasisa amana wákota muna masuwa mu kukwenda ku sambwa dikwawu dya yanga dya thibu.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muvimbu wa Bafwadisi yi wa Eloti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mth 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Balonguki bázimbakana mu kunata mapha. Dipha dimosi lwesi bákaladyawu mu masuwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yesu wábakebisa: «Kebenu! Dikengenu ku muvimbu wa bafwadisi yi muvimbu wa Eloti.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Balonguki bakala tendana bawu yi bawu kikuma bákalaku yi mapha. <verse eid="MRK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yesu wábakulabwa amana wábazimbwala: «Kikuma kya biki lubati tendanina ni lweku yi mapha? Khaniku kedi lubakisa? Khaniku kedi lumona? Mbundu zazitama ziluyenina? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Lwenina yi mesu amana lwisiku mona? Lwenina yi matu amana lwisiku yuka? Lwisiku yubuka: <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>ha yíbukuna mapha matanu kikuma kya bayakala mafunda matanu, bitunga bya kabasi bikwa bya bitini bya mapha bina lwátonguna?» Bavutudini: «kumi yi byodi». <verse eid="MRK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>«Amana tangwa yíbukuna mapha tsambwadi kikuma kya mafunda maya ma bayakala; bitunga bya kabasi bikwa bya bitini bya mapha bina lwatonguna?» Bavutudini: «Tsambwadi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Amana kakala bazimbwala: «Khaniku kedi lubakisa kwenu?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubukini phofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Buna bátula ku Betisayita, bamunatini phofu mosi, bamubokwadidi ni kamusimba. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesu wámusimba phofu muna koku amana wámulubula mu hata. Kunima wámusya metya muna mesu amana wámusya moku, wumuhyudini: «Kima wubati mona?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Phofu wátemuna mesu amana wuzimbudini: «Mbati mona batu, mbati bamona hanga miti kaasi babati kangala.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Yesu wámusya hika moku muna mesu; phofu wákola amana wekina mona mboti-mboti bima byosu. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Hanga wumusendi ni kavutuka ku nzu yandi, mu kuzimbula: «Vutukaku ku hata.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wusamuni ni Yesu kenina Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mth 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yesu yi balonguki bandi bénda ku mahata mana menina bela-bela yi Sezale dya Fidiphu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sezale dya Fidiphu: Mbanza mosi yenina kuna kabeta ka mamba ma Yolutani, Eloti Fidiphu wátungaya. Buthwena bisiya tela ni Banyasi.</char></note>. Muna nzila, wáyandika mu kuhyula kwena balonguki bandi: «Biki bisi zonza batu kikuma kya meni?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Bamuzimbwadini: «Bahika bisi zonza ni ngeyi wenina Yowani Mubotiki, bakwawu ni ngeyi Diya, bakwawu hika phi ni ngeyi wenina mosi hana kati dya bambikudi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Yandi wubahyudini: «Amana kwena benu, nati lwisi zimbula yenina meni?» Phetelu wumuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi wenina Kidisitu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Yesu wátomabakandisa ndangu bazimbulaku kima kitadidi yandi kwena mutu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni lufwa yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mth 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Hanga Yesu wuyandikini kubalonga: «Bulungi ni Mwana wa mutu kanyokuka lawu, bamulosila kwena bambuta ba Bayuta, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku, bamúhondisa amana kafútumuka kunima dya bilumbu bitatu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Yesu kákalabwa zonza wengele. Hanga Phetelu wumunati ku kabeta wekina mukaya. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Kaasi Yesu wábaluka, wábatala balonguki bandi amana wámukaya Phetelu: «Katuka, awenda ku manima ma meni, Satana! Mukuma wisiku banza hanga Nzambi, kaasi hanga batu.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Kunima Yesu kahanga wutedi mulumba-lumba wa batu yi balonguki bandi amana wubazimbwadini: «Yuka ni mutu wuzodini kandanda, kadizimbakana yandi meni, katikula kitakani kyandi amana kandanda. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Mukuma, wosu wuna watónda mu kuhulula luzingu lwandi, katótisalwa; kaasi wosu wuna watótisalwa kikuma kya meni yi kikuma kya Musamu wa Bukheti kahúlulalwa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Amana khi wawu mupfunu kwena mutu wa kuvwila kwandi tsi yosu amana katotisa luzingu lwandi? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Mutu, biki kafwani mu kuhana tambwa-tambwa yi luzingu lwandi? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Mukuma, wuna wangyúka tsoni yi ndinga zama ku mesu ma batu ba mbandu yayi bakonda kwikama yi ya basumuki, Mwana wa mutu phi tsoni kamúyuka tangwa kakwísa mu khembu ya Tata wandi yi yina ya banzyo ba Nzambi.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Yesu wábazimbwala hika: «Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadini, ndambu ya batu mu kati dya baba benina haha benina haha bafwaku kedi konda kumona Kipfumu kya Nzambi buna kyakwísila yi ngolu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kudibalumuna kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mth 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Kunima dya bilumbu bisambanu, Yesu wábonga Phetelu, Zyaki yi Yowani phangi wandi, hanga wubanati bawu buhika ku phungamu hana mongu wumosi wa kaleyi. Kwakuna, ku phungamu. Yesu wábalumuka hana mesu ma bawu; <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>miledi myandi myakala kedyamina mu phembi yimosi yina kalendaku mu kusemisa kwena mutu wa ha tsi yayi. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Diya yi Moyize bádimonikisa kwena bawu, yi kuyambilaka yi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Phetelu wázimbula kwena Yesu: «Mulongi, bulungi ni twakala kwetu kwakuku. Tutungenu masombolu matatu, dimosi kikuma kya ngeyi, dikwawu kikuma kya Moyize, dikwawu hika kikuma kya Diya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Kámonaku mayakwadi, mukuma bweya bwábakwata. <verse eid="MRK 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Hanga kwisi tuti dimosi dyábafidinga yi kivula kya dyawu, amana ndinga yáyukalakana: «Yandu kenina Mwana wama watondama, muyukilenu!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Muna mbala mosi, bátala hana bákala, kaasi bámonaku hika mutu mukwawu; Yesu lwesi yandi buhika yi bawu meni. <verse eid="MRK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Mu kukulumuka kwa bawu kuna mongu, Yesu wábakandisa mu kumenika kwena mutu mana bámona yikuna káfutumukina Mwana wa mutu, ku bafwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Básimbidilaya ndinga meni yayina, kaasi kuna yi kudihyulaka bawu yi bawu: «Biki disongidila dya "kufutumuka ku bafwa"?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Bakala muhyula: «Kikuma kya biki balongi ba mitsiku bisi zimbwala ni Diya fwani mu kutekila kwisa?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Yandi wábavutwala: «Diya kafweti tekila kwisa ndangu kalongika byosu. Amana kikuma kya biki básonikina ni Mwana wa mutu kanyókuka amana kaléwuka? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Kaasi yiluzimbwadini ni Diya wísa kedi amana bámuhanga buna bázola, bwosu buna básonika kikuma kya yandi.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuki mwana wakala yi kitembu kya mbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mth 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Buna bátula bela-bela yi balonguki bahika, bámona mulumba-lumba wa batu lawu babazingiki balongi ba mitsiku bakala tendana yi balonguki. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Buna bámumona Yesu, báyituka lawu amana bénda thinu ndangu bamuheka mboti. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yandi wábahyula balonguki bandi: «Biki lukadi tendanina yi bawu?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Yakala mosi, muna mulumba-lumba wámuvutwala: «Mulongi, yikunatini mwana wama wuna wenina yi kitembu kya kamama. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Kwosu kuma kimukwatidini, kyisi mulemba ha tsi, hanga mwana wuyandiki kulubuka mafulu-fulu yi kudyaka makwenzi, amana yandi mutu wekina sununu. Yibabokwadidiki balonguki baku mu kukukwasa kitembu kina, kaasi balendikisikikyoku.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Benu mbandu yakonda lukwikilu! Yi kuna khi tangwa yikadiki yi benu? Yi kuna khi tangwa yilutambwasiki? Mundatinenu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Bámunatina yandi. Buna kámona Yesu, kitembu kyambi kyámunikisa ngolu; wábwa ha tsi amana weka dibundumuna yi mafulu-fulu kaki-kaki. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesu wáhyula kwena tata wandi: «Tukidila mvula kwa kedi kisi bela bwabubu?» Tata wandi wávutula: «Tukidila kimwana kyandi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Mbala za lawu, kitembu kyisi mulundika ku mbawu ho loni mu mamba ndangu kyamuhonda. Kaasi yuka ni wufwani mu kuhanga kima, tuyukila kiwayi amana awisa tusadisa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesu wumuzimbwadini: «Ho walenda! Moosu malendakana kwena wuna wisi kwikila.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Muna mbala mosi, tata wa mwana wákalunga: «Khwikidini, awisa tsadisa kikuma kya kukonda kwa lukwikilu kwama!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesu buna kámona mulumba-lumba wa batu wakala yikama hika; kahanga wukayi kitembu kya mbi mu kuzimbwalakya: «Kitembu kya muhunga yi kahuwa, meni yikuhekini muswa, lubuka mwena mwana yandu amana wuvutukamwoku hika!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Kitembu kyálubuka mu kukalunga yi kukonya kwa lawu. Mwana wekina hanga wuna wufini; muna phila meni yana, batu bahika bakala zimbula: «Mwana wufini.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Kaasi Yesu, buna kámusimba mwana kuna koku, wámutelamisa, mwana phi wekina mutendendi. <verse eid="MRK 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Tangwa kávutuka Yesu ku nzu, balonguki bandi báyandika mu kumuhyula mu kingenga: «Kikuma kya biki tulendidikiku mu kukukwasakya betu-betu kitembu meni kina?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Mbandu ya kitembu kina yisi lubukila lwesi mu lombilu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni hika lufwa lwandi yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mth 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Buna bákatuka hahana, báhitila mu Ngadidi. Yesu kázolaku ni bamubakula kuna kenina. <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>Mukuma kakala balongisila balonguki bandi yi kubazimbwalaka: «Mwana wa mutu bámulambula ku moku ma batu, bamúhonda amana kunima dya bilumbu bitatu bya lufwa lwandi, kafútumuka.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Kaasi balonguki bakalaku bakisa thendula ya ndinga yina; amana bákala yi bweya bwa kumuhyula byufu.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani wenina mbuta mu kati kya balonguki?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mth 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Bátula ku Kafadinawumi. Tangwa bákala muna nzu, Yesu wáhyula kwena balonguki: «Tendu dya biki lukadiki dyawu mu nzila?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Kaasi bawu bádibata, mukuma, mu nzila, bakala tendana bawu yi bawu mu kuzaya keti nati wenina mbuta. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Hanga wuzakadini, wátela bawu kumi yi bodi amana wábazimbwala: «Yuka mutu wuzodi kukala watheti, kakala watsuka ha kati dya batu boosu yi musadi wa batu boosu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Hanga wubongi mwana wakhunda mosi, wámusya hana kati dya bawu amana, kunima dya kumuzangula, wábazimbwala: <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>«Wosu wuna wayámba mwana mosi wakhunda, hanga yandu, mu khumbu ya meni, meni-meni kayambini; amana wosu wuna wungyambini, kayambiku lwesi meni, kaasi wuyambi phi wuna wáthuma.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuna wukondi mubwisa Yesu kenina yi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yowani kázimbula kwena Yesu: «Mulongi, tumonikini mutu mosi wisi kukwasa bitembu bya mbi mu khumbu ya ngeyi, amana tusandikini mu kumukandisabwa, kikuma kisiku landa betu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Lumukandisabwoku, mukuma heku mutu wasála kiphadi mu khumbu yama amana muna mbala mosi kenda zonza hika mambu mambi matadidi meni. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Kikuma, wuna wisiku tubwisa, hakimosi kenina yi betu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Amana wosu wuna walúheka kopha dya mamba mu khumbu ya buna lwenina kwena Kidisitu; abwabuna, yiluzimbwadini, kalendalwoku totisa lufutu lwandi.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikuma bya phukumunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mth 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>«Wosu wuna wuhukumuni mosi wa bana ba khunda baba bisi kwikila mwena meni, bulungi kwena yandi bamuzitikila kalunga tadi hana tsingu amana bamudibula muna dingu dya yanga dya mbuta. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Yukani koku dyaku dyakusumunaka, bukunadya; bulungi kwena ngeyi wakota mu luzingu yi koku dimosi, ka mboti ku ni wakala yi moku maku modi amana wenda ku bilungi, kuna kwisiku zima mbawu. [<verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Kuna, "mimvidya mina misi vukula lutu misiku fwa amana mbawu yisiku zima."]<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzila yani yenina mu khunga, muna masonuku ma lawu mana ma thama, yisimwoku kala.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Yukani ni kitambi kyaku kyakusumunaka, bukunakya; bulungi kwena ngeyi wakota mu luzingu yi kitambi kimosi, ka mboti ku ni wakala yi bitambi byaku byodi amana bakulosa ku bilungi. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Kuna, "mimvidya mina misi vukula lutu misiku fwa amana mbawu yisiku zima."]<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzila yani yenina mu khunga, muna masonuku ma lawu mana ma thama, yisimwoku kala.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Yuka phi ni disu dyaku dyakusumunaka, vusadya, bulungi kwena ngeyi wakota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi yi disu dimosi; ka mboti ku ni wakala yi mesu modi amana bakulosa ku bilungi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Kwakuna, "mimvidya mina misi vukula lutu misiku fwa, amana mbawu yisiku zima." <verse eid="MRK 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Kikuma, kosu mutu katwa mungwa wa mbawu<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzonzidi yayi "Kutwa mungwa wa mbawu" yibati fwanakana yi bimenga bya bayuta bina byákala yi mungwa (Lev 2:13). Bimenga byalawu bakalabya yoka yi mbawu. Mbawu yenina kidimbu kya phasi holo bimeka bina bakala kukula balonguki boosu. Phasi meni zina zálunga mu kubakitula batu ba Nzambi kuluta amana zakala basadisa mu kutadilaka lwesi mwena Nzambi. </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>«Mungwa wenina kima kya bukheti; kaasi yuka ni munzenzu wuhwini, yi biki bavútwalawa hika? Kalenu yi mungwa mwena benu-benu, amana zingilakenu mu ngemba benu yi benu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Malongi ma Yesu kikuma kya kufwa kwa longu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mth 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Yesu buna kákatuka hahana, wisa ku kinzunga kya Yuteya yi kuna sambwa dikwawu dya Yolutani. Milumba-lumba mya batu myákhokama hika bela-bela yi yandi; bwosu kyákala kikalulu kyandi, wáyandika mu kubalonga. <verse eid="MRK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Bafwadisi bisa muhyula, ndangu bamuleya. Bámuhyula: «Yakala kenina yi muswa wa kuyambula mukhetu wandi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yesu wábavutwala: «Khi mutsiku káluheka Moyize?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Bawu bázimbula: «Moyize wáhana muswa wa kusonikina mukanda wa kufwa kwa longu yi wa kukula.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Moyize, kikuma kya mbundu ya tadi yina lwenina yawu, káluhekila mutsiku wuna." <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Kaasi ku luyandiku lwa phangamu, Nzambi kábahanga yakala yi mukhetu. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>"Kikuma kya bwabuna, yakala kasísa tata wandi yi ngudi wandi amana kadínama yi mukhetu wandi, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>amana bawu bodi bakítuka mutu mosi." Yihana ni beku hika bodi kaasi mutu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masonuku mahika meku yi mihowu myami, kaasi mya kuhingisa mu mihowu myahika: "mu kukhundakana kwena mukhetu wandi". </char></note> mosi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Mutu kahambulaku kina kakhundikisini Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Buna bátula ku nzu, balonguki bámuhyula hika byufu kikuma kya dyambu meni dina. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Wuna wayámbula mukhetu wandi amana kakwela wahika, wuti mbongi ku thwala wuna watheti; <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>amana yuka ni mukhetu kadihambula yi yakala dyandi amana kakwela wahika, wuti mbongi.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusakumuni bana bakhunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mth 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Batu bakala munatina bana ndangu kabasimba kuna moku, kaasi balonguki bakala bakaya. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Mu kumona bwabuna, Yesu wáyuka khabu amana wábazimbwala: «Yambulenu bana bakhunda bisa kwena meni! Lubakandisaku, mukuma Kipfumu kya Nzambi kyenina kikuma kya batu bana benina hanga bawu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Abwabuna, yiluzimbwadi: wosu wuna wakonda yamba Kipfumu kya Nzambi hanga mwana wakhunda, kakótamwoku.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Kunima wábazangula muna moku mandi amana wábasakumuna mu kubathetikaka moku.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi Mutu wa mvwama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mth 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Bwosu kakala kwenda muna nzila, yakala mosi wísa thinu amana wáfukama kuna thwala ya Yesu mu kumuhyula: «Mulongi wa bukheti, biki pfwani yihanga mu kuvwa luzingu lwa mvula yi mvula?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Kikuma kya biki wuthedidini wa bukheti? Heku mutu wenina wa bukheti ho ka Nzambi lwesi ku. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Wuzayi mitsiku myami: "Wuhondaku mvumbi ya khengu, wutaku mbongi, wuyibaku, wutaku kimbangi kya bukamvi, wuhunaku musamu, zitisa tata waku yi ngudi waku.» <verse eid="MRK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Yandi wumuvutwadini: «Mulongi, mambu mana mosu yisima zitisa tukidila kileki kyama.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesu wámutala amana wámutonda, wumuzimbwadini: «Kima kimosi kikukondini: ndawenda, tekisa byosu bina wenina byawu, hanabya kwena batsukamini, amana watámbula kuvwa ku zilu; kunima nzawisa amana ndanda.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Kaasi yandi buna káyuka ndinga meni yina, kiwayi kyámukwata amana wénda mu kyadi, mukuma bima bya lawu kákala byawu.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yesu buna kátala muna kabeta kandi, wuzimbudini kwena balonguki bandi: «Phasi bwenina kwena bana benina yi bimvwama mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Balonguki báyituka lawu kikuma kya ndinga zandi. Kaasi Yesu wávutwakila: «Bana bama, phasi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phasi: masonuku mahika mabati hana tsikiningi ni kwena babana bisi dihana mu bimvwama. </char></note> bwenina mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Bweku phasi kwena kamela mu kulobuka ha hundu dya ndongu, kaasi phasi lawu kwena mvwama mu kukota mu Kipfumu kya Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Balonguki báyituka hika lawu, bakala dihyula bawu yi bawu: «Amana nati walenda huluka?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesu wábatala amana wuzimbudini: «Mana malendakanaku kwena batu, malendakana kwena Nzambi; mukuma heku dyambu dyakonda lendakana kwena Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Phetelu wáyandika mu kumuzimbwala: «Tala betu, tusisini bima byetu byosu amana tulandi ngeyi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesu wávutula: «Abwabuna, yiluzimbwadibwa: heku mutu wásisa nzu, baphangi ba bayakala, baphangi ba bakhetu, ngudi, tata, bana kondilo mafu, kikuma kya meni yi kikuma kya Musamu wa Bukheti; <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>amana kakonda tambula mbala khama<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khama yibati songila lufutu luna lwa mbuta kahána Nzambi kwena bana bisi musadila muna phila meni yayi. </char></note> buthwena bwabu: nzu, baphangi ba bayakala, baphangi ba bakhetu, bangudi, bana, yi mafu yi munyanga phi; amana muna tsi yina yakwísa, kakonda tambula moya wa mvula yi mvula. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Lawu bakala batheti, basúkinina amana lawu bakala batsuka, batékila.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni mu mbala ya tatu lufwa lwandi yi lufutumuku lwandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mth 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Mu nzila bákala mu kutombuka ku Yelusalemi. Amana Yesu kakala kwenda ku thwala ya bawu. Balonguki mu tsumbi bákala, bana bakala mulanda phi, bweya bakala bwawu. Yesu wábonga hika bawu kumi yi bodi, bela-bela yi yandi, amana wáyandika mu kubazimbwala mambu mama makhana mubwila. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Kábazimbwala: «Talenu, ku Yelusalemi tubati tombuka; Mwana wa mutu bamúlambula kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi kwena balongi ba mitsiku. Ndola ya lufwa bamúzengila, bamúlambula kwena baphani. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Bamúseya, bamúlokwala metya, bamúzyatula amana bamúhonda. Amana kunima bilumbu bitatu, kafútumuka.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilomba kya Zyaki yi Yowani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mth 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Bana ba Zebeteya bodi, Zyaki yi Yowani, bísa muzimbwala: «Mulongi, twazóla ni wahanga kikuma kya betu mana twakúlomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yandi wubahyudini: «Biki luzodi ni yihanga kikuma kya benu?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Bawu bamuzimbwadini: «Tuheka nzila ni twazakala mosi kuna koku dyaku dya kitata, mukwawu kuna koku dyaku dya kimama muna khembu yaku.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Kaasi Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Lwisiku zaya mambu mana lwisi lomba. Lwalenda kunwa bungu dyadi yinwa meni, kondi loni kutambula mbotika yayi yitámbula meni?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Bawu bamuzimbwadini: «Twalendabwa.» Yesu wubavutwadini: «Bungu dyadi nzodi yinwa meni, lwanwádya, amana balubotika phi mu mbotika yayi yitámbula meni. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Kaasi mana matadidini kuzakala ku kitata kyama holo ku kimama kyama, ka meni ku yisima hana; bifulu bina byenina kikuma kya bana báyidikilabya.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Kumi bana bahika báyuka bwabuna, hanga babafungidi khabu Zyaki yi Yowani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Yesu wábatela amana wubazimbwadini: «Luzayi ni malemba ma makanda bisi yala batu hanga bapfumu, amana bambuta bisi songila kwena bakwawu hamu dya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Dyeku buna mu kati dya benu, kaasi wuna wazola, mu kati dya benu, kukituka mbuta, kakála musadi wenu, <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>amana wosu wuna wuzodi kukala watheti mu kati dya benu, kakála muhika wa batu boosu. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Mukuma keti yandi meni Mwana wa mutu kísaku ndangu bamusadila, kaasi kikuma kya kusadila yi kulambula luzingu lwandi mu phila ya kukatula batu balawu mu kihika.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubukini phofu Balatimeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mth 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Bisi ku Yediko. Amana buna kálubuka Yesu mu Yediko, yi balonguki bandi yi mulumba-lumba wa batu, phofu mosi wakala lomba bima muna nzila, khumbu yandi Balatimeya, mwana wa Timeya, kákala wazakala kuna kabeta ka nzila. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Wáyuka ni wuna Yesu mwisi Nazaleti amana wáyandika kukalunga: «Yesu, Mwana wa Tavidi, ngyukila kyadi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Balawu bakala mukaya ndangu kadibata, kaasi yandi wákalunga hika ngolu: «Mwana wa Tavidi, ngyukila kyadi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yesu wátelema amana wuzimbudini: «Mutelenu.» Bámutela phofu yi kumuzimbwalaka: «Sya kikesa, telema, kabati kutela.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Wálosa muzaka wandi, wátelama mbala mosi amana wísa kuna kákala Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesu wámuhyula: «Biki wuzodi yikuhangila?» Phofu wámuzimbwala: «Mulongi, nzodi yimona hika.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesu wámuzimbwala: «Ndawenda, lukwikilu lwaku lukuhuludini<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fwani twazonza ni "lukuhuludini" kondilo "lukubeludini".</char></note>.» Muna tangwa meni dina, wáyandika kumona, amana wámulanda muna nzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukoti mu Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mth 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ywn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Amana Tangwa bábwesuka yi Yelusalemi, mu kukwenda ku hata dya Betifasi yi Betaniya, bela-bela yi mongu wa Olive, Yesu wátuma bodi ba balonguki bandi <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>mu kubazimbwala: «Alwenda kuna hata dina dyenina ku thwala ya benu, buna lwakóta, lwawána mwana wa ane<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna bikalulu bya bikanda byahika, mbisi wuna ane bakala musadila hanga mbisi wuna wisi tikula mazitu. Kenina wakhunda kuluta baphunda bana bakodini. Bisi muzayila muna matu mandi ma kaleyi. Ane kenina kidimbu kya kudikulumuna kwa Masiya.</char></note> wakuzitikila, wuna bakonda kedi zakala kwena mutu; mukutumunenu, amana mundatinenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Amana yuka ni mutu kaluzimbwala: kikuma kya biki lubati hangila bwabuna?" Zimbulenu: "Pfumu mupfunu kamuvwini." Amana, muna mbala mosi, kamúsula.»<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Bénda amana báwana mwana wa ane wa kuzitikila hana nzila, bela-bela yi mwelu wumosi, muna nzila. Bamukutumuni. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Ndambu ya batu bana bákala hana báyandika mu kubazimbwala: «Biki lubati hanga? Kikuma kya biki lubati mukutwamina mwana wa ane wuna?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Bábavutwala bwosu kázimbulabwa Yesu, amana bábasula. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Bámunata mwana wa ane kwena Yesu; báthetika miledi mya bawu hana thandu ya yandi, Yesu wázakala hana thandu. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Batu balawu báyala miledi mya bawu muna nzila, amana bahika yi ndala zina bákesa<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwosu bwenina muna mukanda wazodi wa bathotila 9:13, wuna wenina mutindu wa kikalulu kya luzitu. </char></note> mu bilanga. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Bana bakala kwenda ha thwala yi bana bakala landa bakala kalunga: «Ozana<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna ndinga ya Bayuta, Ozana yenina nzonzidi yibati tendula lwesi ni "Hulula, yikubokwadidini." </char></note>! Kasakumuka wuna wubati kwisa mu khumbu ya Pfumu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>Lwasakumuka luyalu luna lubati kwisa, luyalu lwa Tavidi tata wetu! Ozana muna bisoka!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesu wákota mu Yelusalemi, kuna nzu ya Nzambi. Kunima dya kusimbululaya bima byosu yi bwosu kwáyila kuma, wénda ku Betaniya kumosi yi bawu kumi yi bodi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubundidini mufiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mth 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Kilumbu kyálanda, bwosu kakala lubuka ku Betaniya, Yesu wáyuka nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Buna kámona muna kyana mufiki wávwota yi khaya, wenda tala akolu kawanakwa kima; kaasi buna katula hahana, káwanaku keti kima, khaya za khatu, mukuma yákalaku tsungi ya bibundu bya fiki. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Hanga wuzimbudi kwena mufiki: «Mvula yi mvula, ka mutu ku wadya hika kibundu kyatúka mwena ngeyi!» Amana balonguki bandi bámuyuka.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu kuna Nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mth 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ywn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Bátula ku Yelusalemi. Yesu wákota kuna nzu ya Nzambi, wáyandika mu kukwasa bana bakala tekisa yi bana bakala sumba kuna nzu ya Nzambi, wámwanga mitalaka mya bakwa tsyenzya yi biti bya bateki ba baphombu, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>konda kusisa mutu kanata kima muna luphangu lwa nzu ya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Kakala balonga yi kuzimbulaka: «Bwásonamaku bwabu: "Nzu yama batédikiya ni nzu ya bisambu kikuma kya bikanda byosu?" Kaasi benu, lukitudiya saka dya bandwandwa!» <verse eid="MRK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku bámuyuka; bakala sanda phila ya kumuhondisila; bweya bwa yandi bákala bwawu, kikuma mulumba-lumba wa batu wosu wakala yituka kikuma kya malongi mandi. <verse eid="MRK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Ha mabwa masikidika, Yesu yi balonguki bandi bálubuka mu mbanza.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu yi mufiki wayumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mth 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Buna bakala hita muna suka, balonguki bámona mufiki wayumuka yi kuna misodi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Phetelu, bwosu káyubuka mana máhita, wumuzimbwadini: «Mulongi, talandi, mufiki wawu wábundila wosu wuyumukini.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Kwikilenu mwena Nzambi! <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Abwabuna, yiluzimbwadibwa, wuna wazímbula kwena mongu wawu: "Kinduka hana, dilosa mu yanga dya mbuta," konda keti keti muna mbundu yandi, kaasi kakwikilaka ni mamana kabati zimbula malúngila, mamana mamúhangamina. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Yihana yiluzimbwadini: "Kyosu kina lwalómba mu kulombila, kwikilenu ni lutambudikya kedi amana balúhekakya." <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>"Amana buna lutelamikini mu kulombila, yuka ni dyambu lwenina dyawu yi mukwenu, mulolulenu, ndangu Tata wenu wenina muna mazilu kalulolula phi mitsoki myenu. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Kaasi yukani lubaloludiku, Tata wenu wuna wenina mu mazilu, ketibwe kalúlolulaku mitsoki myenu.]<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzila yayi yenamwoku muna masonuku ma lawu mana ma khulu. </char></note>»<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ku biki disi tuka hamu dya Yesu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mth 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Yesu yi balonguki bandi bávutuka ku Yelusalemi. Bwosu kakala kangala muna luphangu lwa nzu ya Nzambi, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi, balongi ba mitsiku yi bambuta ba dibundu bisa muwana. <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>Amana bamuhyudini: «Mu hamu dya nati wisi hangila bwabuna? Nati wukuhekini hamu dya kuhangilabwa?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesu wubavutwadini: «Meni phi yilúhyula kyufu kimosi; yuka ni lwamvutwala, yiluzimbwala keti mu hamu dya nati yisi hangila mambu mana. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Mbotika yina ya Yowani, ku zilu yátuka ho kwena batu? Phekenu mvutu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Kaasi báyandika kutendana bawu yi bawu yi kudizimbwalaka: «Yuka ni twavutula: "Ya ku zilu", kazímbula: "Kikuma kya biki lwakonda mukwikidila?" <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Kaasi yuka twazimbula: "Kwena batu", hanga...» Bweya bwa mulumba-lumba wa batu bákala bwawu, mukuma boosu bakala mubongila Yowani hanga mbikudi mosi wa kyedika. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Hanga bavutudi kwena Yesu: «Tuzayiku.» Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Meni phi yiluzimbwalaku keti mu hamu dya nati yisi hangila mambu mana.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya basadi bambi ba kilanga kya vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mth 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Hanga Yesu wuyandikini mu kubazonzila mu bingana: «Mutu mosi wákuna kilanga kya vinu. Wákakakya mu luphangu, wásima buku dya kinyongi kya vinu, wátunga kinongi kikuma kya kutanikinaka vinu, kunima wáluwisakya kwena batu, amana wénda mu kitambu. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Tangwa dya mbongu buna dyálungila, wátuma musadi mosi kwena basadi ba vinu ndangu bamubongila ndambu yandi ya bibundu bya vinu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Bámukwata, bámubeta amana bámukukwasa moku ma khatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Mukwa kilanga wábahitika hika musadi wahika; bámukhokula muna mutwa amana bámutukwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Wátuma hika musadi wahika, bámuhonda; kunima balawu bábeta bwabuna, bahika bábahonda. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Mwana wandi wa yakala wuna watondama lwesi wásala; ku tsuka, wábahitika yandi mu kudizimbwala: "Bámuzitisa mwana wama wa yakala!" <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Kaasi basadi babana ba kilanga kya vinu bádizonzila: "Yandu swana! Alwisenu, tumuhondenu, ndangu kuvwa kwasadila betu!" <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Bámukwata, bámutimbula ku phenza ya kilanga kya vinu amana bámuhonda.<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>«Amana biki kahánga mukwa kilanga kya vinu? Kakwísa, wubahondisini basadi bana, amana kiyeka kya kilanga kya vinu kahánakya kwena basadi bahika. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Benu lwátangaku Masonuku mama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">"Tadi dina bálosa batungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">dyákituka tadi dya theti dya mupfundila.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Mambu mama kwena Pfumu mátuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">dyambu dya ngituka ku mesu metu!"»<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Bapfumu ba bayuta bakala sanda phila ya kumukwatila, kaasi báyuka bweya bwa mulumba-lumba wa batu. Bábakula ni kikuma kya bawu kátila kingana kina. Bámusisa amana bénda kwabawu.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phaku ya Khayisala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mth 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Bamuhitikini ndambu ya bafwadisi yi bakwa kibuka kya Eloti, ndangu bamuleya Yesu muna ndinga zandi. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Baba bisa muzimbwala: «Mulongi, tuzayi ni ngeyi kyedika wena amana weku yi bweya bwa mambu mana bisi banza batu kikuma, wisiku tala mbunzu za batu, kaasi wisi longa nzila ya Nzambi buna bufwani. Bulungi mu kufuta phaku ya Khayisala<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Khayisala" yákala khumbu yina bakala hana kwena pfumu wa mbanza ya Loma. Káyala phi muna tsi za lawu zina zákala mu kihika kya Loma, yi muna tsi za Bayuta. </char></note>? Tufweti futa ho tufutaku?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Bwosu kázaya bukavungalosi bwa bawu, wábavutwala: «Kikuma kya biki lubati ndeyila? Ndatinenu kuta dimosi, nzodi yimonadya.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Bámunatinadya dimosi, Yesu wábahyula: «Mbunzu yi khumbu yayi básonika haha bya nati?» Bámuvutwala: «Bya Khayisala.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Hanenu mambu ma Khayisala kwena Khayisala, amana mambu ma Nzambi kwena Nzambi.» Amana báyituka lawu kikuma kya mvutu ya Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyufu kitadidi kufutumuka kwa bafwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mth 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Kunima, Basadise bana bisi zimbula ni kweku lufutumuku lwa bafwa, bisa muhyula: <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>«Mulongi, Moyize kátusonikina bwabu: "Yuka ni yakala mosi kafwa konda kubuta mwana, myaki wandi kalunga kwela mufwidi ndangu katombula kikanda kya phangi wandi." <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Kinga kwákala yi baphangi ba bayakala tsambwadi. Tsomi za bawu wákwela mukhetu amana wáfwa konda kusisa mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Wazodi wámukwela mufwidi amana wáfwa konda kusisa keti mwana. Phila mosi yi wuna watatu; <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>amana keti mosi wa bawu tsambwadi kásisaku mwana. Kunima dya bawu boosu, mukhetu phi wáfwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Muna kilumbu kya lufutumuku lwa bafwa, tangwa batókama, wa nati kakála mukhetu meni wuna? Mukuma bawu tsambwadi bámukwela!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Taleti! Yi hakana lwisi ditotisila kwenu, lwisiku bakisa keti Masonuku, keti ngolu za Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Mukuma, ku lufutumuku lwa bafwa, kwakálaku yi bayakala keti bakhetu bakwélana, kaasi bakála hanga banzyo muna mazilu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Kikuma kya kufutumuka kwa bafwa, khaniku kedi lutanga, muna mukanda wa Moyize, mana bámuzimbwala bela-bela yi kivunza kya mbawu? Nzambi kázimbula: "Meni yenina Nzambi wa Bulahami, Nzambi wa Yizaki yi Nzambi wa Yakobi." <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Disongidila ni keku Nzambi wa bafwa, kaasi wa batu bana benina mu luzingu. Luditotisi kwenu kimakulu.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutsiku wulutini mupfunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mth 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Mosi wa balongi ba mitsiku, wuna wábayuka buna bakala tendana yi phila kámona ni mboti kábavutwala, wísa hyula kwena Yesu: «Khi wawu mutsiku watheti wuhitini muna mitsiku myosu?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesu wuvutudini: «Watheti: "Hinikina, Kiseledi, Pfumu Nzambi wetu, yandi lwesi wenina Pfumu<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Basoniki bahika básonika ni Pfumu kenina Nzambi wetu, Pfumu yandi mosi.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Amana wazóla Pfumu Nzambi waku, yi mbundu yaku yosu yi moya waku wosu, yi ngangu zaku zoosu, yi ngolu zaku zoosu." <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Wazodi: "Wazóla mukwenu hanga ngeyi meni." Kweku hika mutsiku wuluti myami myawu myodi.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Mulongi wa mitsiku wumuzimbwadini: «Bwa bukheti, Mulongi! Kyedika wuzimbudini ni Pfumu Nzambi yandi mosi kenina amana heku wahika hanga yandi. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Amana ni kumuzola yi mbundu yandi yosu, yi ngangu zandi zoosu, yi ngolu zandi zoosu; yi kuzola mukwenu hanga yandi meni, buluti kimenga kya kuyoka kya muthu yi mikhayilu.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesu buna kámona ni kávutula yi mayedi moosu, hanga wumuzimbwadini: «Ngeyi weku kyana yi Kipfumu kya Nzambi.» Amana keti mutu kámekaku hika kumuhyula kyufu.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya yi Tavidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mth 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Yesu kakala longa kuna nzu ya Nzambi, kahanga wubahyudini: «Abweti balongi ba mitsiku balenda zonzila ni Masiya kenina mwana wa Tavidi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Yandi meni Tavidi, muna Kitembu Kyatoma, kázimbula:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">"Pfumu kázimbula kwena Pfumu wama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">sikuka kuna kitata kyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">yi kuna yisíla bambeni baku ku sina dya bitambi byaku."<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Yandi meni Tavidi kabati mutela: "Pfumu" Amana mu biki kalenda kadila hika mwana wandi?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu wubalukisi kikuma kya balongi ba mitsiku</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mth 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Amana mulumba-lumba wa batu balawu bakala muhinikina yi tsambu. <verse eid="MRK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Muna malongi mandi, Yesu kakala bazimbwala: «Dikengenu yi balongi ba mitsiku; bazodi kukangala yi mvwela za kaleyi amana batu babahekaka mboti muna mazandu; <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>bazodi kuzakala mu bifulu bya theti muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta, bazodi phi bifulu bya lukumu mu mikinzi. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Bisi botula bima muna nzu za bafwidi, bisi samba malombilu ma kaleyi kikuma kya kudimonikisa. Bawu batámbula pfundusu yina yalúta kitesu.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kabu dya mufwidi wa phutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Kunima Yesu bwosu kákala wasikuka kuna thwala ya mukunzu wa nzu ya Nzambi, kakala simbulula mulumba-lumba wa batu buna bakala sya mbongu. Bamvwama balawu bakala sya lawu. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Mufwidi mosi wa phutu wísa, yandi phi wásya makuta modi ma khunda mahitini dikuta dya tsuka. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Hanga wubatedi balonguki bandi amana wubazimbwadini: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa, mufwidi yandu wa phutu kasini kuluta boosu bana basini mu mukunzu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Mukuma boosu bana báhani muna kulutuka kwa kuvwa kwa bawu; kaasi yandi, kásini muna kiphutu kyandi, kyosu kina kákadiki kyawu, kyosu kina kafwaniki mu kuzingila.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni kubulumuka kwa nzu ya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mth 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Bwana kakala lubuka Yesu mu nzu ya Nzambi, mosi wa balonguki bandi wámuzimbwala: «Mulongi! Talandi, khi mutindu wa matadi, khi thungidi!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesu wámuvutwala: «Wumoni thungidi zazi za mbuta? Kwasálaku keti tadi dimosi hana thandu ya tadi dikwawu dyakonda wulumuka.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phasi yi minyanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mth 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Buna kákala wazakala kuna mongu wa Olive, kuna thwala ya nzu ya Nzambi, Phetelu, Zyaki, Yowani yi Andele bámuhyula mu kingenga: <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>«Tuzimbwala, khi tangwa masálama mambu mama, khi kyawu kidimbu kyasóngila tsuka ya mambu mana moosu?.»<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Hanga Yesu wuyandiki mu kubazimbwala: «Kebenu, mutu kaluhukumunaku. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Lawu bakwísa mu khumbu ya meni, mu kuzimbula: "Meni yenina Kidisitu" amana batu balawu babáhukumuna. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Tangwa lwayúka kuzonzila mvita yi pfweta-pfweta za mvita: luvumukaku mbundu; bulungi ni mambu mana masalama, kaasi yakálaku kedi tsuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Mukuma kanda dimosi dyanwánisa kanda dikwawu, amana luyalu lumosi lwanwánisa luyalu lukwawu; amana kunikana kwa mafu yi nzala byakála muma mwahika. Lwakála luyandiku lwa misongu. <verse eid="MRK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>Dikengenu benu-benu; balúlambula mu nganda amana balúbeta muna nzu za kimvuka za Bayuta; lwatélama kuna thwala ya bapfumu ba mbanza yi bakyamvu kikuma kya meni, kyakála kimbangi kikuma kya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Bulungi theti Musamu wa Bukheti basamunawa kwena makanda moosu. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Tangwa balúnata mu kululambula, lutekilaku diyangisa kikuma kya mana lwazímbula, kaasi zimbulenu mana balúheka muna tangwa meni dina, mukuma ka benu ku lwazónza, Kitembu Kyatoma. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Phangi kalámbula phangi wandi ku lufwa, amana tata kalámbula mwana wandi; bana babáthutukila bibuti bya bawu amana babáhondisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Balúmenga kwena mutu wosu kikuma kya khumbu yama. Kaasi wuna wakwámina tii yi kuna tsuka, yandi kahúluka.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwayi kya lawu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mth 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>«Buna lwamóna muzangi wanzanzi wakutelamisa muna kafwaniku kukala, mutu wuna wubati tanga kabakula! Hanga, bana bakála mu Yuteya batína mu myongu; <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>wuna wakála ha mudilu katulukahoku, kavutukaku kikuma kya kutambula kima ku nzu yandi; <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>amana wuna wakála ku bilanga kavutukaku ku manima kikuma kya kutambula muledi wandi. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Khi phasi kikuma kya bakhetu bana bakála ku bifundu yi kwena bana bakála mu kuyemika muna bilumbu meni bina! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Lombilenu ni mambu mama mabwaku mu tangwa dya kyosi kya lawu! <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Mukuma, bilumbu meni bina byakála bilumbu bya kiwayi kya lawu, kiwayi kimosi, hanga kina kyakonda kedi kala tukidila ku luyandiku lwa phangamu yina káhangila Nzambi tsi yi buthwena bwabu, amana zakálamwoku hika buna kuluta. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Wadi ni Pfumu kákufikisaku bilumbu bina, wadi keti mutu kakhanaku zinga hika, kaasi kákufikisilabya kikuma kya bana básolama. <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Amana ho mutu kaluzimbwala: "Kidisitu haha kenina!" Holo: "kuna kenina!" Lumukwikilaku. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Mukuma bamasiya<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamasiya ba bukamvi babati zonzila batu bana bisi zimbula ni bawu benina Kidisitu kaasi beninabwoku. </char></note> ba bukamvi yi bambikudi ba bukamvi balúbuka; basóngila biphadi yi mambu ma kuyituka kikuma kya kuhukumuna, yuka bwaléndakana, bana kásola Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Kebenu kwenu! Thekidi luzimbwala moosu.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwisa kwa Mwana wa mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mth 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>«Kaasi muna bilumbu bina, kunima dya kiwayi meni kina, tangwa kaphínda, ngondi kaséngulaku myesi myandi, <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>bathetimbwa babwa tukidila ku zilu, amana ngolu za mazilu zaníkana. <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Hanga bamoni Mwana wa mutu buna kakwísa muna matuti yi ngolu za lawu, yi khembu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Hanga wutumi banzyo amana bakútikisa batu ba tselu ya bana kásola, tukidila tselu ya tsi yi kuna tselu ya ku zilu.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingana kya mufiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-33">Mth 24:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>«Mbandu ya kingana kya mufiki yaluheka dilongi: buna lwamóna ni miti wusawakidini, lwisi zaya ni tsungi ya pha yibwesukini. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Phila mosi yi kwena benu, tangwa lwamóna bima bina byosu, zayenu ni Mwana wa mutu wekina bela-bela, muna mwelu. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadibwa: mbandu ya batu baba, yahítaku kedi yi kuna masálamina mambu mana moosu. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Zilu yi tsi byatóta, kaasi ndinga zama zalendaku tota.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi lwesi wuzayidya tangwa dya tsuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mth 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>«Kikuma kya mana matadidini kilumbu yi tangwa, ka mutu ku wuzayibya, keti banzyo muna zilu, keti Mwana; kaasi Tata yandi lwesi. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Kebenu, temunenu mesu, mukuma luzayiku mu khi tangwa mabwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Dyakála hanga mutu mosi wénda mu kitambu: wusisini nzu yandi, wuhanini kiyeka kwena basadi bandi; kosu mutu yi kisalu kyandi, amana wásenda kwena tsinzidi kakala watemuna. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Disongidila, kalenu batemuna, mukuma luzayiku keti khi tangwa kakwísa mukwa nzu: mu masikidika, ho mu kati kya kisuku, ho mu khoku wa theti, ho mu suka. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Kalenu mu bweya kinga katula mu kithulumukina amana kisa luwana banimba. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Mana mbati luzimbwala, nzimbudima kwena batu boosu: "Kalenu batemuna!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukasidi kifwandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mth 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ywn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Bilumbu byodi byásala mu kuta mukinzi wa Phaki yi mukinzi wa mapha makonda muvimbu. Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi balongi ba mitsiku bakala sanda phila ya kumukwata Yesu mu mayedi mambi ndangu bamuhonda. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Bakala zimbula: «Heku ni mu tangwa dya mukinzi, hanga kwakala nana mvwalangani mu kati dya batu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukhetu mosi wusitini mananasi hana mutwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mth 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Ywn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesu ku Betaniya kákala muna nzu ya Simoni mukwa bwasi. Buna kákala ku mesa mukhetu mosi wákota amana kákala yi mulangi wabasa yi mananasi ma mukwandi, ma thalu ya lawu. Wábula mulangi amana wázunzila mananasi hana mutwa wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Ndambu ya batu bahika báyuka kikudi-kudi, hanga beka dizimbwala bawu yi bawu: «Kikuma kya biki kuzanga mananasi mama bwabu? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Wadi bakhanima sumbisa mananasi mana mu thalu ya khama tatu za phata<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mlk 6:37 lufutu lwa basadi khama tatu muna kilumbu.</char></note>, amana mbongu bahana kwena batsukami!» Amana bakala mukumba mukhetu wuna. <verse eid="MRK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Kaasi Yesu wázimbula: «Muyambulenu. Kikuma kya biki lubati muyangisila? Dyambu dya bukheti kahangini kwena meni. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Mukuma, batsukami lwakadiki bawu kosu tangwa, amana lufwani kubasadisa tangwa dina lumoni; kaasi meni twakádikiku yenu kosu tangwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Yandi kahangi buna kálendidini: katekidi zunzila mananasi mu lutu lwama kikuma kya kuyidika kuzika kwa lutu lwama. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Mu kyedika yiluzimbwadini: kwosu kuna básamuna Musamu wa Bukheti, muna tsi yosu, baménikiki phi mambu mama kahangini mukhetu yandu, kikuma kya kumubambuka.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yutasi wuyilamini mu kulambula Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mth 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Yutasi Sikadyoti, mosi wa bawu kumi yi bodi, wénda kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi ndangu kabalambwala yandi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Buna bámuyuka, básangwala lawu amana básila ni bamuheka mbongu. Yutasi kakala sanda tangwa dya mboti ndangu kamulambula Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudi madya ma Phaki yi balonguki bandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mth 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ywn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Kilumbu kya theti kya mukinzi wa mapha makonda muvimbu, muna kilumbu kina bakala tambika kimenga kya mukinzi wa Phaki, balonguki bandi bamuzimbwadini: «Kubiki wuzodi ni thwenda kuyidikila madya ma mukinzi wa Phaki?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Hanga Yesu wátuma bodi mu kati dya balonguki bandi amana wubazimbwadini: «Alwenda kuna mbanza, lwatúndakana yakala mosi wubati nata kalondu kenina yi mamba. Mulandenu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Amana muna kakóta, zimbulenu kwena mukwa nzu: "Mulongi kazimbudini: Kubiki wenina mwanza wuna yidíla madya ma Phaki yi balonguki bama?" <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Kalúsongila mwanza wumosi wenina wambuta kuna zilu, wenina wakuyidika kedi yi bima byosu. Yi mwamuna lwayídikila mambu kikuma kya betu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Balonguki bénda, buna bátula ku mbanza, báwana phi mambu bwosu kábazimbwala amana báyidika madya ma Phaki.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Ha mábwa masikidika, Yesu wátula hakimosi yi bawu kumi yi bodi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Buna bákala kuna mesa yi kudyaka, Yesu wuzimbuni: «Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadini: mosi mu kati dya benu, wubati dya yi meni, kandámbula.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Kiwayi kyábakwata lawu, báyandika mu kumuzimbwala mosi kunima mukwawu: «Ka meni ku, bweku?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Yandi wábavutwala: «Kenina mosi muna kati dya benu kumi yi bodi, wuna wuvundikini koku ha longa dimosi yi meni, yandi wuna wandámbula. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Mwana wa mutu kabati kwenda, bwosu bwásonama kikuma kya yandi; kaasi khi kyadi kwena mutu wuna wamúlambula Mwana wa mutu! Bwálunga ni mutu wuna kabutukaku kwandi!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa ma Pfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mth 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Buna bákala dya, Yesu wátambula dipha, wásambuladya, wábukunadya amana wáhanadya kwena balonguki mu kuzimbula: «Tambulenu, lwalu lwenina lutu lwama.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Kunima, wátambula bungu dimosi, kunima dya kuvutula matondu, wábahekadya, amana bánwaya boosu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Hanga wubazimbwadini: «Mama menina menga mama, ma bulunda bwa Nzambi, mana matyakani kikuma kya batu lawu. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Mu kyedika, yiluzimbwadini: yinwaku hika vinu dina, tii yi kuna kilumbu kina yinwádya, dya pha, muna luyalu lwa Nzambi.»<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuni ni Phetelu kámusuwangana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mth 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ywn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Kunima dya kuyimbila mikunga<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyákala kikalulu kya kuyimbilaka mikunga ku madya ma Phaki. </char></note>, bálubuka, benda ku mongu wa Olive. <verse eid="MRK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Hanga Yesu wubazimbwadini: «Kisinza kyakála kikuma kya benu boosu, mukuma bwásonama bwabu: "Yimúhonda kalema, amana mikoku myamwángalakana." <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Kaasi kunima dya kufutumuka kwama, yilútekidila kuna Ngadidi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Phetelu wumuzimbwadini: «Tangwa kyakála kisinza kikuma kya boosu, kyakálaku kikuma kya meni.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesu wámuvutwala: «Mu kyedika yikuzimbwadini: lelu, muna phipha meni yayi, khoku kakókulaku kedi mbala zodi, ngeyi watsúwangana mbala tatu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Kaasi Phetelu wávutula yi ngolu zoosu: «Keti kufwa, yifwa hakimosi yi ngeyi, yikusuwanganaku.» Balonguki boosu bázimbula phi phila mosi.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lombilu lwa Yesu kuna Ngetisemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mth 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Bisa tula homa hamosi bisi tela mu khumbu ya Ngetisemani, amana Yesu wázimbula kwena balonguki bandi: «Zakalenu haha, kithama kina yikwata lombila.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Wábonga ha kimosi yi yandi Phetelu, Zyaki yi Yowani. Amana wáyandika kuyuka kyadi yi kiwayi. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Hanga wubazimbwadini: «Mbundu yama mu kiwayi yenina yi kuna lufwa; salenu haha, amana kalenu batokama.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Buna káphusana ndambu, wábwa ha tsi amana wálombila ni, yuka bwalendakana, tangwa meni dina dyahaluka yi yandi. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Kakala zimbula: «Aba, Tata, moosu maléndakana kwena ngeyi; halula kwena meni bungu dyadi. Kaasi ka luzolu lwa meni ku kaasi luzolu lwaku lwahangama.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Yesu wísa kwena balonguki bawu batatu amana kábawana banimba; wázimbula kwena Phetelu: «Simoni, wunimbi? Wulendiku mu kutokama keti tangwa dimosi? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Kalenu batemuna, lombilenu phi, ndangu lubwaku mu kimeka. Kitembu kyazyama kyenina kaasi lutu lwalembwa lwenina.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Wáhaluka hika amana wálombila mu kulandulula ndinga zimosi meni. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Kunima wisa vutuka hika, wubawani ku kilu, mukuma mesu ma bawu zitu mákala. Bámonaku biki bamuzimbwala. <verse eid="MRK 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Yesu wisa vutuka mu mbala ya tatu amana wábazimbwala: «Lunimbi hika, lulembwiki kwenu? Yimeni, tangwa dibwesukini. Mwana wa mutu bamulambudi ku moku ma basumuki. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Telamenu, thwendenu! Tala, wekina bela-bela wuna ndambudini!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukwatini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mth 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Ywn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Muna tangwa meni dina kakala zonza Yesu, Yutasi, mosi wa bawu kumi yi bodi wátula hahana, hakimosi yi mulumba-lumba wa batu bakala yi mbedi za phoku yi khindi hana moku. Bábatuma kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi, balongi ba mitsiku yi bambuta ba bayuta. <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Yutasi wuna wakala mulambula, watekila basongila kidimbu kimosi mu kuzimbula: «Wuna yibumbakana, yandi wuna. Mukwatenu amana munatenu buna bwa bukheti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Buna kátula, wubwesukini kuna kákala Yesu, wuzimbudini: «Labuni!» Amana wámubumbakana. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Hanga batu meni bana bamubwidini Yesu amana bamunatini. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Mosi wa bana bákala hahana, wáhola mbedi ya phoku, wámutapha musadi wa mbuta wa banganga Nzambi amana wámuhuta kwiti. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesu wábazimbwala: «Lwisi khwata yi mbedi yi khindi, hanga mbedi ni ndwandwa yenina? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Yíkala yenu bilumbu byosu kuna nzu ya Nzambi mu kulongaka, amana lwákhwataku. Kaasi mamana mabwini ndangu malungila Masonuku.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Hanga boosu bamusisini, amana batini kwabawu. <verse eid="MRK 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Ngunza mosi wakala mulanda, wadivunga muledi wa thangi. Bámukwata, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>kaasi yandi wásutula muledi amana wátina kikhonga.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ku thwala ya kimvuka kya mbuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mth 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Ywn 18:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Yesu, bamunata ku nzu ya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi, kuna bákutakanina bambuta ba banganga Nzambi boosu, bambuta ba bayuta yi balongi ba mitsiku. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Phetelu kakala mulanda kuna kyana, yi kuna kyanzala kya nzu ya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi. Buna kákota muna kati, wázakala yi batsinzidi<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhowu wa ngeleki wuna bábindula mu "batsinzidi" wenina muhowu wumosi wuna wubati zonzila "basadi". Batu ba mayedi ma lawu bana ba Bibila bisi kumbwala ni bayakala meni babana bawu bákala batsinzidi ba nzu ya Nzambi ya bayuta. Babana bakala lemvuka ku milongi mya mbuta wa banganga Nzambi. Bákalaku baphumbulu ba bisi Loma.</char></note>, kikuma kya yikuyeta mbawu. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi kimvuka kyambuta<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mth 5:22. </char></note> bakala sanda kimbangi kya mbi kikuma kya Yesu, ndangu bamuzengila ndola ya lufwa, kaasi bámonakyoku. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Mukuma lawu dya bambangi ba luvunu bisa funda, kaasi bimbangi byáfwananaku. <verse eid="MRK 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Ndambu ya batu bálubuka mu kumutila kimbangi kyaki kya luvunu: <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>«Twámuyuka yandu mu kuzimbula: "Yiwúlumuna nzu ya Nzambi yayi bátunga ku moku ma batu, amana mu bilumbu bitatu, yitúngulula yikwawu yina yakonda tungama ku moku ma batu."» <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Amana mbatanana buna, bimbangi bya bawu byákalaku fwanana. <verse eid="MRK 14:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Hanga mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wutelami hana kati dya lukutakanu, wáyufula kwena Yesu: «Keti kima wubatiku vutula? Biki wuzonzi kikuma kya bimbangi byabi babati kufundila baba?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Kaasi Yesu kakalaku yakula, kakalaku vutula keti ndinga. Mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wámuhyula hika: «Ngeyi wenina Kidisitu, Mwana wa Nzambi wasambuka?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesu wávutula: «Meni yandu. Amana lwamóna Mwana wa mutu wazakala kuna koku dya kitata dya Nzambi mukwa Ngolu zoosu amana kakwísa muna matuti ma zilu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Hanga mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wuyati miledi myandi<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyákala kikalulu kya bayuta, kikuma kya mutu mosi, mu kuyata miledi myandi tangwa kayukini ni mutu wahika ngusi kabati tukwana Nzambi. Mbuta wa banganga Nzambi kásongila haha bwosu kákwikila yandi ni Yesu ngusi kátukwana Nzambi.</char></note>, amana wuzimbudini: «Kikuma kya biki twasandila hika bambangi? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Luyuki benu-benu ngusi katukwani Nzambi; Abweti lubanzi benu?» Boosu bázimbula ni kufwa muna kufwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Hanga batu bahika bamuhumi metya kuna mbunzu, bamufidingi mbunzu amana bamuti makufi mu kuzimbula: «Bikuleti, keti nati wukubetini!» Amana batsinzidi bamuti mbata.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phetelu wumutuni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mth 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Ywn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Buna kákala Phetelu wazakala kuna phenza, hana kyanzala, musadi mosi wa mukhetu wa mbuta wa banganga Nzambi wátula. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Buna kámona Phetelu wakala yeta mbawu, wámutala amana wuzimbudini: «Ngeyi phi, wukadikini yi Yesu, mwisi Nazaleti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Kaasi yandi wásuwangana mu kuzimbula: «Nzayiku, mbatiku bakula mana wuzodi wazimbula, ngeyi.» Kunima wálubuka ndangu kenda ku mwelu wa kyanzala; [hanga khoku mosi wukokuni.]<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mihowu myami myenina mu khunga, myenamwoku muna masonuku mahika.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Musadi wa mukhetu wámumona hika amana wáyandikila mu kuzimbula kwena babana bákala hakana: «Yandu phi kenina mosi wa bawu!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Amana yandi wásuwangana hika. Kunima dya tangwa dya khunda, babana bákala hakana bázimbula hika kwena Phetelu: «Kyedika, ngeyi wenina mosi wa bawu, mukuma mwisi Ngadidi phi wenina.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Hanga Phetelu wuyandiki mu kudya ndefi: «Yukani meni yimuzayi mutu yandu, Nzambi kapheka ndola!» <verse eid="MRK 14:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Amana muna tangwa meni dina, khoku wákokula mu mbala ya zodi. Phetelu wáyubuka ndinga yina kámuzimbwala Yesu: «Khoku kakókulaku kedi mu ya mbala zodi, ngeyi watsúwangana meni mbala tatu.» Hanga wuyandiki mu kudila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamunati ku nganda ya Philatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mth 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ywn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Kuma buna kwákhya, bambuta ba banganga Nzambi bákutakana hakimosi yi bambuta ba bayuta yi balongi ba mitsiku mu kimvuka kya mbuta. Kunima dya kumukasa Yesu, bámunata amana bámulambula kwena Philatu<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Philatu kakala kilolu mwisi Loma mu kinzunga kya Yuteya tukila mvula 26-36 ku nima lubutuku lwa Yesu Kidisitu. Philatu kakala yi mikanu mya lawu kwena Bayuta muna tangwa dina kakala kilolu kya mbanza. Mbala za lawu, kakala tonda kulungisa luzolu lwa Bayuta kikuma kya mikanu. Kakhana totisa kifulu kyandi kya kilolu mu mbanza wadi ni kakalaka yi mikanu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Amana Philatu wámuhyula: «Ngeyi, kyamvu wa Bayuta wenina?» Yesu wumuvutwadini: «Ngeyi meni wuzimbudibwa.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Bimbangi lawu bakala mutila kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Philatu wámuhyula hika: «Wubatiku vutula keti kima? Tala moosu mana babati kufundila!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Kaasi Yesu kávutulaku hika keti kima, amana Philatu wáyituka lawu.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamuzengidi ndola ya lufwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mth 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Ywn 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Bwosu bwákala ni mu mukinzi wosu wa Phaki, Philatu kakala sula mutu wa boloku mosi, wosu wuna bakala lomba batu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Kinga yakala mosi, khumbu yandi Balabasi, wákala mu boloku hakimosi yi bandwandwa, kikuma kya buna káhonda mutu mu tangwa dya mvwalangani. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Mulumba-lumba wa batu bénda kuna nzu ya Philatu amana báyandika mu kumulomba ni kabahangila bwosu kyákala kikalulu kya bawu. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Philatu wábahyula: «Luzodi yiluyambwadila kyamvu wa Bayuta?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Mukuma wázaya kwandi ni, bapfumu ba banganga Nzambi, kikuma kya kiphala bámulambwala yandi. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Kaasi bambuta ba banganga Nzambi bálundika batu ndangu balenga bayambwadila kaka Balabasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Philatu wáhyula hika: «Amana biki yihanga buthwena kikuma kya yandu lwisi tela ni kyamvu wa Bayuta?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Bákalunga hika: «Mukhoka ha kitakani!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Philatu wábahyula: «Khi mbi kahangini?» Kaasi bawu bákalunga hika ngolu: «Mukhoka ha kitakani!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Philatu wázola kasephidisa mulumba-lumba wa batu, wábasudila yandi Balabasi. Kunima dya kumuzyatwasa mafimbu Yesu, wámulambula ndangu bamukhoka ha kitakani.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baphumbulu bamuseyi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mth 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Ywn 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Baphumbulu bámubulumuna Yesu yi muna kyanzala kya nganda ya pfumu wa mbanza, amana bákhokika kibuka kya baphumbulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Bámuvwatisa mvwela ya kabengi<note caller="b" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mvwela ya kabengi: muledi wumosi wa thalu wa kabengi, wuna bakala vwatisa lwesi kwena bakyamvu yi kwena batu ba mupfunu wa lawu.</char></note> amana bátunga mukhonzi wumosi wa tsaku, bávwatisawa kuna mutwa wandi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Kunima báyandika mu kumuheka mboti: «Mboti, kyamvu wa Bayuta!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Bakala muzyatula muswangina muna mutwa, kumuhuma metya yi kufukamaka kuna thwala ya yandi. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Tangwa bamanisa mu kumuseya, bámukatulaya mvwela yina ya kabengi amana bámuvwatisa hika miledi myandi. Kunima bámunata ku phenza ndangu benda mukhoka ha kitakani.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamukhoki ha kitakani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mth 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ywn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Mu kunata kitakani kyandi, baphumbulu bálundika mutu mosi wakala hita, wátuka ku bilanga, Simoni mwisi Sileni, tata wa Alekizande yi Lufwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Amana bámunata Yesu yi hana homa hana bisi tela ni Kolukota, disongidila: «Kizika kya Kibelengenzi kya mutwa.» <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Bázola ni bamuheka vinu dya kusanga mila<note caller="d" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mila yi vinu bakalabya sadila hanga bilongu mu kulembika phasi za mutu wuna bakhokini ha kitakani.</char></note>, kaasi yandi wábwisadya. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Bámukhoka ha kitakani, amana bákabana miledi myandi mu kubetilamya zeki ndangu bazaya kina káfwana kubonga kosu mutu. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Dyákala tangwa dya vwa dya suka, ha bámukhoka ha kitakani. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Bisona bina bánamika byákala tendula kikuma kya ndola yandi, byákala yi mihowu myami: «Kyamvu wa Bayuta.» <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Hakimosi yi yandi, bákhoka hana kitakani bandwandwa bodi, mosi ku koku dyandi dya kitata, mukwawu ku koku dyandi dya kimama. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Bwabuna málungila mana básonika mu nzila ya Masonuku: «Bámusya mu kanga dya batu bambi.»]<note caller="e" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzila yayi yeninamwoku muna masonuku ma lawu mana ma thama.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Bana bákala mu kuhita, bákala mutukwana yi kunikisaka mutwa mya bawu; yi kuzimbulaka: «He! Ngeyi wakala zimbula ni wáwulumuna nzu ya Nzambi amana mu bilumbu bitatu wutunguludiya, <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>dihulula ngeyi meni amana tuluka ha kitakani!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Phila mosi phi kwena bambuta ba banganga Nzambi yi kwena balongi ba mitsiku bakala museya yi kuzonzaka: «Batu bahika kakala hulula amana kafwaniku kudihulula yandi meni! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Kidisitu, kyamvu wa Kiseledi, katuluka buthwena ha kitakani, ndangu twamona amana twakwikila.» Batu bana bámukhoka bawu ha kitakani bákala mutukwana phi.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mth 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ywn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Tuka tangwa dya tsinzi, phipha yábwa muna kinzunga kina kyosu tii yi kuna tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Muna tangwa dya tatu dya masikidika, Yesu wákalunga mu ndinga ya ngolu: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lema sabakatani?» Disongidila: «Nzambi wama, Nzambi wama, kikuma kya biki wungyambwadidini?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Bahika, mu kati dya bana bákala hahana, bámuyuka, bazimbudini: «Talandi, Diya, kabati tela yandu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Mutu mosi wátyakula thinu, wábonga kitini kya vuya, wávundikikya muna vinu dya ngani, amana wázitikadya ku muswangina, kamuheka yandi ndangu kanwa. Amana wuzimbudini: «Yambulenu, twatala kamba Diya kakwisa mutulula hahana!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Kaasi Yesu wákalunga hika mu ndinga ya ngolu amana wátabula moya.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Kutala muledi wa zitu wuna wakala kabisa kizika kyahedila yi kina kyákala kyahedila kuluta mu nzu ya Nzambi wuyatukini mu byati byodi tuka ku londi yi kuna banda<note caller="f" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzu ya Nzambi yakala yi miledi myodi. Watheti wakala mu mwelu wa kizika kyahedila. Kizika kyahedila kyakala mbasi ya theti muna nzu ya Nzambi. Muledi wa zodi wakala ha kati dya kizika kyahedila yi kina kyahedila kuluta. Mbuta wa banganga-Nzambi lwesi wakala kota muna kizika kina kyahedila kuluta, mbala mosi muna mvula. Nzila yayi yibati zonzila muledi wa zodi. (Khaphu ya 26:3; Heb 9:3) </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Buna kámona phila yina káfwila, hanga satudiyoni wuna wákala hakana, kuna thwala yandi, wuzimbudini: «Mu kyedika, mutu yandu Mwana wa Nzambi kákadikini!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Hákala phi yi bakhetu bakala tala kuna kyana. Hana kati dya bawu, hákala yi Madiya mwisi Makatala, Madiya ngudi wa Zyaki wakhunda yi Zoze yi mukhetu wahika Salomeyi. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Babana bakala mulanda, bakala musadila phi tuka ku Ngadidi. Hákala hika yi bakhetu balawu bana bátombuka hakimosi yi yandi ku Yelusalemi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bamuzesi mu mazyamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mth 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ywn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Masikidika hana mabwi kedi, yi bwosu kyákala kilumbu kina kyatekidila sabata, kina bakala yidikila mukinzi, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>wisa tula Yozefu, mwisi Adimateya, wuna bakala zitisa phi ku kibuka kyambuta. Kakala hingila yandi phi Kipfumu kya Nzambi. Wenda kwena Philatu mu kulomba lutu lwa Yesu<note caller="h" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kulomba lutu: muna kikalulu kya bawu, mutu wuna wufwidini ha kitakani mu mesu ma thona, bisiku muzika yi luzitu.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Philatu wáyituka lawu mu kuyuka ni wutabudiki kedi moya, wátedisa satudiyoni amana wámuhyula yuka ni thama katabwadikini moya. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Buna káyuka meni dya satudiyoni, wáhana muswa kwena Yozefu mu kubonga mvumbi. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yozefu wásumba muledi wa thangi, wámutulula Yesu ha kitakani, wámuvunga hana muledi wa thangi<note caller="i" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muna tsadidi ya Bayuta, bakala vuya mananasi ma mutindu yi mutindu amana basitima kuna muledi wa kuvungila mvumbi kikuma kya kumufundika (Ywn 19:39-40). </char></note> amana wámusikula muna mazyamu mana básima muna kitadi. Kunima wákidika kalunga tadi kuna mwelu wa mazyamu. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Madiya mwisi Makatala yi Madiya ngudi wa Zoze bakala simbulula bamona homa hana bámusya.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Lufutumuku lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mth 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ywn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Buna dyáhita sabata, Madiya mwisi Makatala, Madiya ngudi wa Zyaki yi Salomeyi básumba mananasi kikuma kya kusita lutu lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Muna kilumbu kyatheti kya phosa, muna kati kya suka tangwa weka lubuka, bénda ku mazyamu. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Bakala dihyula bawu yi bawu: «Nati watúbundwamina tadi dina dyenina dyakukidika ku mwelu wa mazyamu?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Kaasi buna bávumbula mesu, bámona ni kalunga ka tadi dina, dyakubundumuna kedi kuna kabeta. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Buna bákota muna mazyamu; bámona hakana mwana wa yakala mosi, wasikuka kuna koku dya kitata, wávwata mvwela yimosi ya katoki amana báyuka bweya. <verse eid="MRK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Kaasi wubazimbwadini: «Lukalaku yi bweya; Yesu mwisi Nazaleti lubati sanda, wuna bákhokiki ha kitakani. Wúfutumuki ku bafwa, kenahoku haka. Talenu homa hana bámusikudikini. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Kaasi alwenda zimbula kwena balonguki bandi yi kwena Phetelu: "Wulutekididini muna Ngadidi; kwakuna lwamúmonina, bwosu káluzimbwalabwa."» <verse eid="MRK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Bálubuka mu mazyamu, amana benda thinu, bakala tekita yi kitswi. Amana bámenikinaku keti kwena mutu mukuma bweya bákala bwawu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu wudimonikisi kwena Madiya mwisi Makandala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mth 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Ywn 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<note caller="a" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tukila nzila ya vwa yi kuna nzila ya makumodi zenamwoku muna masonuku ma lawu mana ma khulu. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Kunima dya lufutumuku lwandi, muna suka-suka dya kilumbu kyatheti kya phosa, Yesu wádimonikisa theti kwena Madiya mwisi Makatala, mwena yandi kálubula bitembu bya mbi tsambwadi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Madiya wenda nata musamu kwena babana bákala yi Yesu. Mu khondu bákala yi kudilaka. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Tangwa báyuka kuzimbula ni Yesu mu luzingu kákala amana wámumona, bawu bákwikilaku.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisongidi kwena balonguki bodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Kunima dya bwabuna, Yesu wádimonikisa, mu mutindu wahika kwena balonguki bodi hana kati dya bawu bakala kwenda mu mahata. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Bisa vutukisa bawu phi mu kusamunabwa kwena bakwawu, kaasi keti bawu phi bábakwikilaku kaka.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudisongidi kwena balonguki kumi yi mosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mth 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ywn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mhb 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Ku tsuka, Yesu wisa disongila kwena balonguki kumi yi mosi buna bákala kuna mesa; amana wábakaya kikuma kya kukonda kwa lukwikilu lwa bawu yi mbundu ya tadi ya bawu, kikuma bákwikilaku mwena batu bana bámumona kunima dya kufutumuka kwandi. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Kunima wubazimbwadini: «Alwenda muna tsi yosu amana samunenu Musamu wa Bukheti kwena phangamu yosu. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Wuna wakwíkila, watámbula phi mbotika kahúluka; kaasi wuna wakwíkilaku bamúzengila ndola. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Talenu bidimbu babázayila bana bakwíkila: bakúkwasa bitembu bya mbi mu khumbu ya meni; bazónza mu ndinga za pha; <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>Bakwáta banyoka kuna moku, honi banwini ndikila, keti ya khi mutindu, yabáhangaku keti kima; bathétika moku kwena bambefu amana bawu phi bakwata kola.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thombuka ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Mhb 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Kunima dya kubazonzisa, Pfumu Yesu bámutombula ku zilu, amana wázakala kuna koku dya kitata dya Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Amana balonguki benda mwangisa musamu muma mwosu. Pfumu kákala hakimosi yi bawu amana kakala lungisa Ndinga muna bidimbu bya khumbwa bina kákala byawu.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
